msgid "Represents the final desired Device description to be used in Cacti.  The following replacement values can be used: |sysName|, |ipAddress|, |dnsName|, |dnsShortName|, |sysLocation|.  The following functions can also be used: CONCAT(), SUBSTRING(), SUBSTRING_INDEX().  See the MySQL/MariaDB documentation for examples on how to use these functions.  An example would be: CONCAT('|sysName|', SUBSTRING('|sysLocation|',1,3)).  Take care to include quoting around the variables names when used in the supported MySQL/MariaDB function examples."
msgstr "Maneho ny famaritana ny fitaovana farany iriana hampiasaina ao amin'ny Cacti. Ireto sanda fanoloana manaraka ireto dia azo ampiasaina: |sysName|, |ipAddress|, |dnsName|, |dnsShortName|, |sysLocation|. Azo ampiasaina ihany koa ireto asa manaraka ireto: CONCAT(), SUBSTRING(), SUBSTRING_INDEX(). Jereo ny torolàlana MySQL/MariaDB raha te hahita ohatra momba ny fampiasana ireo asa ireo. Ohatra iray amin'izany ny: CONCAT('|sysName|', SUBSTRING('|sysLocation|',1,3)). Tandremo mba hampiditra tsipy teny manodidina ny anaran'ireo miovaova rehefa ampiasaina amin'ireo ohatra asa MySQL/MariaDB tohanana."

