#: data_templates.php
msgid "WARNING: This change will not change either the step or the heartbeat of existing RRDfiles.  After this change, a Rebuild Poller Cache operation will take place in background to update the data collection cycle for the impacted Data Sources.  It is strongly suggested that you either delete all the impacted RRDfiles afterwards, or use the splice_rrd.php CLI script to preserve old data and repopulate the new RRDfiles with the legacy data.  Otherwise, this change will have no on the data and may in fact lead to a loss of fidelity if you are increasing the time between data collection cycles."
msgstr "FAMPITANDREMANA: Ity fanovana ity dia tsy hanova na ny dingana (step) na ny fitepon'ny fo (heartbeat) amin'ireo RRDfiles efa misy. Aorian'ity fanovana ity dia hisy asa fanarenana ny Cache-n'ny Poller hatao any ambadika hanavaozana ny tsingerin'ny fanangonana angon-drakitra ho an'ireo Loharanon-drakitra voakasika. Soso-kevitra mafy ny hamafanao avy eo ireo RRDfiles rehetra voakasika, na hampiasa ny soratra baiko CLI splice_rrd.php mba hitahirizana ny angon-drakitra taloha sy hamenoana indray ireo RRDfiles vaovao amin'ny angon-drakitra teo aloha. Raha tsy izany dia tsy hisy fiantraikany amin'ny angon-drakitra ity fanovana ity ary mety hitarika fahaverezan'ny fahamarinan'ny angon-drakitra aza raha ampitomboinao ny elanelam-potoana eo anelanelan'ny tsingerin'ny fanangonana angon-drakitra."

