msgid "Using Slope Mode evens out the shape of the graphs at the expense of some on screen resolution."
msgstr "Ny fampiasana ny Fomba mitongilana dia mampahalama ny endriky ny kisary saingy mampihena kely ny fahazavan'ny sary eo amin'ny efijery."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Scaling Options"
msgstr "Safidy momba ny maridrefy"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Auto Scale"
msgstr "Maridrefy mandeha ho azy"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Auto scale the y-axis instead of defining an upper and lower limit. Note: if this is check both the Upper and Lower limit will be ignored."
msgstr "Mampiasa maridrefy mandeha ho azy ho an'ny teza-y fa tsy mamaritra fetra ambony sy fetra ambany. Fanamarihana: raha voamarika ity dia tsy hojerena ny Fetra ambony sy ny Fetra ambany."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Auto Scale Options"
msgstr "Safidy momba ny maridrefy mandeha ho azy"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Use <br> --alt-autoscale to scale to the absolute minimum and maximum <br> --alt-autoscale-max to scale to the maximum value, using a given lower limit <br> --alt-autoscale-min to scale to the minimum value, using a given upper limit <br> --alt-autoscale (with limits) to scale using both lower and upper limits (RRDtool default) <br>"
msgstr "Ampiasao ny <br> --alt-autoscale hanitsiana ny maridrefy amin'ny farany ambany sy farany ambony tanteraka <br> --alt-autoscale-max hanitsiana ny maridrefy amin'ny sanda ambony indrindra, amin'ny fampiasana fetra ambany voafaritra <br> --alt-autoscale-min hanitsiana ny maridrefy amin'ny sanda ambany indrindra, amin'ny fampiasana fetra ambony voafaritra <br> --alt-autoscale (misy fetra) hanitsiana ny maridrefy amin'ny fampiasana ny fetra ambany sy ambony (safidy mahazatra RRDtool) <br>"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Use --alt-autoscale (ignoring given limits)"
msgstr "Ampiasao ny --alt-autoscale (tsy miraharaha ny fetra voafaritra)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Use --alt-autoscale-max (accepting a lower limit)"
msgstr "Ampiasao ny --alt-autoscale-max (manaiky fetra ambany)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Use --alt-autoscale-min (accepting an upper limit)"
msgstr "Ampiasao ny --alt-autoscale-min (manaiky fetra ambony)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Use --alt-autoscale (accepting both limits, RRDtool default)"
msgstr "Ampiasao ny --alt-autoscale (manaiky ny fetra roa, safidy mahazatra RRDtool)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Logarithmic Scaling (--logarithmic)"
msgstr "Maridrefy logaritmika (--logarithmic)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Use Logarithmic y-axis scaling"
msgstr "Ampiasao ny maridrefy logaritmika ho an'ny teza-y"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "SI Units for Logarithmic Scaling (--units=si)"
msgstr "Singa SI ho an'ny maridrefy logaritmika (--units=si)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Use SI Units for Logarithmic Scaling instead of using exponential notation.<br> Note: Linear graphs use SI notation by default."
msgstr "Ampiasao ny singa SI ho an'ny maridrefy logaritmika fa tsy ny fanoratana eksponansialy.<br> Fanamarihana: Ny kisary tsipika mahitsy dia mampiasa ny fanoratana SI amin'ny fomba mahazatra."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Rigid Boundaries Mode (--rigid)"
msgstr "Fomba fiasa fetra hentitra (--rigid)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Do not expand the lower and upper limit if the graph contains a value outside the valid range."
msgstr "Aza itarina ny fetra ambany sy ambony raha ahitana sanda ivelan'ny elanelana manan-kery ny kisary."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Upper Limit (--upper-limit)"
msgstr "Fetra ambony (--upper-limit)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "The maximum vertical value for the graph."
msgstr "Ny sanda mitsangana ambony indrindra ho an'ny kisary."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Lower Limit (--lower-limit)"
msgstr "Fetra ambany (--lower-limit)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "The minimum vertical value for the graph."
msgstr "Ny sanda mitsangana ambany indrindra ho an'ny kisary."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Grid Options"
msgstr "Safidy momba ny makarakara"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Unit Grid Value (--unit/--y-grid)"
msgstr "Sandan'ny singan'ny makarakara (--unit/--y-grid)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Sets the exponent value on the Y-axis for numbers. Note: This option is deprecated and replaced by the --y-grid option.  In this option, Y-axis grid lines appear at each grid step interval.  Labels are placed every label factor lines."
msgstr "Mametraka ny sandan'ny eksponanta eo amin'ny teza-Y ho an'ny isa. Fanamarihana: Efa lany andro ity safidy ity ary nosoloina ny safidy --y-grid. Amin'ity safidy ity, ny tsipika makarakara amin'ny teza-Y dia miseho isaky ny elanelan'ny dingana makarakara. Ny mari-pamantarana dia apetraka isaky ny tsipika araka ny antony famantarana."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Unit Exponent Value (--units-exponent)"
msgstr "Sandan'ny eksponantan'ny singa (--units-exponent)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "What unit Cacti should use on the Y-axis. Use 3 to display everything in \"k\" or -6 to display everything in \"u\" (micro)."
msgstr "Ny singa tokony hampiasain'ny Cacti eo amin'ny teza-Y. Ampiasao ny 3 hanehoana ny zava-drehetra amin'ny \"k\" na -6 hanehoana ny zava-drehetra amin'ny \"u\" (mikro)."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Unit Length (--units-length &lt;length&gt;)"
msgstr "Halavan'ny singa (--units-length &lt;length&gt;)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "How many digits should RRDtool assume the y-axis labels to be? You may have to use this option to make enough space once you start fiddling with the y-axis labeling."
msgstr "Firy ny tarehimarika tokony hoheverin'ny RRDtool ho an'ny mari-pamantarana amin'ny teza-y? Mety mila mampiasa ity safidy ity ianao mba hahazoana toerana ampy rehefa manomboka manova ny fametrahana mari-pamantarana amin'ny teza-y."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "No Gridfit (--no-gridfit)"
msgstr "Tsy misy fampifanarahana makarakara (--no-gridfit)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "In order to avoid anti-aliasing blurring effects RRDtool snaps points to device resolution pixels, this results in a crisper appearance. If this is not to your liking, you can use this switch to turn this behavior off.<br><strong>Note: </strong>Gridfitting is turned off for PDF, EPS, SVG output by default."
msgstr "Mba hisorohana ny voka-dratsin'ny fanjavozavoan'ny anti-aliasing, ny RRDtool dia mampifanaraka ny teboka amin'ny pikselin'ny fitaovana, izay manome endrika mazava kokoa. Raha tsy tianao izany dia azonao ampiasaina ity fepetra ity hamonoana izany fomba fiasa izany.<br><strong>Fanamarihana: </strong>Ny fampifanarahana makarakara dia maty amin'ny fomba mahazatra ho an'ny vokatra PDF, EPS, SVG."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Alternative Y Grid (--alt-y-grid)"
msgstr "Makarakara Y hafa (--alt-y-grid)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "The algorithm ensures that you always have a grid, that there are enough but not too many grid lines, and that the grid is metric. This parameter will also ensure that you get enough decimals displayed even if your graph goes from 69.998 to 70.001.<br><strong>Note: </strong>This parameter may interfere with --alt-autoscale options."
msgstr "Ny algoritma dia miantoka fa manana makarakara foana ianao, misy tsipika makarakara ampy nefa tsy be loatra, ary metrika ny makarakara. Ity mason-tsivana ity ihany koa dia miantoka fa mahazo desimaly ampy aseho ianao na dia mandeha manomboka amin'ny 69.998 ka hatramin'ny 70.001 aza ny kisarinao.<br><strong>Fanamarihana: </strong>Mety hanelingelina ny safidy --alt-autoscale ity mason-tsivana ity."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Axis Options"
msgstr "Safidy momba ny teza"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Right Axis (--right-axis &lt;scale:shift&gt;)"
msgstr "Teza havanana (--right-axis &lt;scale:shift&gt;)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "A second axis will be drawn to the right of the graph. It is tied to the left axis via the scale and shift parameters."
msgstr "Teza faharoa no hosoritana eo ankavanan'ny kisary. Mifamatotra amin'ny teza havia amin'ny alalan'ny mason-tsivana maridrefy sy fanakisahana izy io."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Right Axis Label (--right-axis-label &lt;string&gt;)"
msgstr "Mari-pamantarana teza havanana (--right-axis-label &lt;string&gt;)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "The label for the right axis."
msgstr "Ny mari-pamantarana ho an'ny teza havanana."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Right Axis Label Angle (--right-axis-label-angle)"
msgstr "Zoron'ny mari-pamantarana teza havanana (--right-axis-label-angle)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Right label rotation in degrees counter clockwise. Requires RRDtool 1.11 or newer. Blank follows the vertical label angle. Angles other than 90 and 270 may overlap nearby content."
msgstr "Fihodinan'ny mari-pamantarana havanana amin'ny degre mifanohitra amin'ny fihodinan'ny famantaranandro. Mitaky RRDtool 1.11 na vaovao kokoa. Ny banga dia manaraka ny zoron'ny mari-pamantarana mitsangana. Ny zoro ankoatra ny 90 sy 270 dia mety hifanindry amin'ny votoaty eo akaiky."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Right Axis Label Range (--right-axis-range)"
msgstr "Elanelan'ny mari-pamantarana teza havanana (--right-axis-range)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Only show right axis labels within min:max, for example 0:100. Either bound may be blank. This does not change the axis scale. Requires RRDtool 1.11 or newer. Blank leaves labels unrestricted."
msgstr "Asehoy ihany ny mari-pamantarana teza havanana ao anatin'ny min:max, ohatra 0:100. Mety ho banga na ny iray amin'ireo fetra aza. Tsy manova ny maridrefin'ny teza izany. Mitaky RRDtool 1.11 na vaovao kokoa. Ny banga dia mamela ny mari-pamantarana tsy hisy famerana."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Right Axis Format (--right-axis-format &lt;format&gt;)"
msgstr "Endriky ny teza havanana (--right-axis-format &lt;format&gt;)"

#: include/global_form.php
#, php-format
msgid "By default, the format of the axis labels gets determined automatically.  If you want to do this yourself, use this option with the same %lf arguments you know from the PRINT and GPRINT commands."
msgstr "Amin'ny alalan'ny fandrindrana fototra, ny endriky ny etikety amin'ny teza dia faritana ho azy. Raha tianao hatao tenanao izany, ampiasao ity safidy ity miaraka amin'ireo mari-pamantarana %lf mitovy amin'izay fantatrao avy amin'ny baiko PRINT sy GPRINT."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Right Axis Formatter (--right-axis-formatter &lt;formatname&gt;)"
msgstr "Mpandrindra ny teza havanana (--right-axis-formatter &lt;formatname&gt;)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "When you setup the right axis labeling, apply a rule to the data format.  Supported formats include \"numeric\" where data is treated as numeric, \"timestamp\" where values are interpreted as UNIX timestamps (number of seconds since January 1970) and expressed using strftime format (default is \"%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S\").  See also --units-length and --right-axis-format.  Finally \"duration\" where values are interpreted as duration in milliseconds.  Formatting follows the rules of valstrfduration qualified PRINT/GPRINT."
msgstr "Rehefa manamboatra ny fametahana etikety amin'ny teza havanana ianao dia ampiharo fitsipika amin'ny endriky ny angona. Ny endrika tohana dia ahitana ny \"numeric\" izay andraisana ny angona ho isa, ny \"timestamp\" izay andikana ny sanda ho mari-potoana UNIX (isan'ny segondra nanomboka tamin'ny Janoary 1970) ary aseho amin'ny endrika strftime (ny fandrindrana fototra dia \"%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S\"). Jereo koa ny --units-length sy --right-axis-format. Farany, ny \"duration\" izay andikana ny sanda ho faharetana amin'ny milisegondra. Ny fandrafetana endrika dia manaraka ny fitsipiky ny valstrfduration ampiasaina amin'ny PRINT/GPRINT."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Left Axis Format (--left-axis-format &lt;format&gt;)"
msgstr "Endriky ny teza havia (--left-axis-format &lt;format&gt;)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Left Axis Formatter (--left-axis-formatter &lt;formatname&gt;)"
msgstr "Mpandrindra ny teza havia (--left-axis-formatter &lt;formatname&gt;)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "When you setup the left axis labeling, apply a rule to the data format.  Supported formats include \"numeric\" where data is treated as numeric, \"timestamp\" where values are interpreted as UNIX timestamps (number of seconds since January 1970) and expressed using strftime format (default is \"%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S\").  See also --units-length.  Finally \"duration\" where values are interpreted as duration in milliseconds.  Formatting follows the rules of valstrfduration qualified PRINT/GPRINT."
msgstr "Rehefa manamboatra ny fametahana etikety amin'ny teza havia ianao dia ampiharo fitsipika amin'ny endriky ny angona. Ny endrika tohana dia ahitana ny \"numeric\" izay andraisana ny angona ho isa, ny \"timestamp\" izay andikana ny sanda ho mari-potoana UNIX (isan'ny segondra nanomboka tamin'ny Janoary 1970) ary aseho amin'ny endrika strftime (ny fandrindrana fototra dia \"%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S\"). Jereo koa ny --units-length. Farany, ny \"duration\" izay andikana ny sanda ho faharetana amin'ny milisegondra. Ny fandrafetana endrika dia manaraka ny fitsipiky ny valstrfduration ampiasaina amin'ny PRINT/GPRINT."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Legend Options"
msgstr "Safidin'ny fanazavana"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Auto Padding"
msgstr "Fampifandanjana elanelana ho azy"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Pad text so that legend and graph data always line up. Note: this could cause graphs to take longer to render because of the larger overhead. Also Auto Padding may not be accurate on all types of graphs, consistent labeling usually helps."
msgstr "Ampio elanelana ny lahatsoratra mba hifanitsy foana ny fanazavana sy ny angon'ny kisary. Fanamarihana: mety hampaharitra kokoa ny famoronana kisary izany noho ny vesatry ny kajy fanampiny. Ankoatra izay, mety tsy ho marina tsara amin'ny karazana kisary rehetra ny fampifandanjana elanelana ho azy; matetika manampy ny fametahana etikety mirindra."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Dynamic Labels (--dynamic-labels)"
msgstr "Etikety miovaova (--dynamic-labels)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Draw line markers as a line."
msgstr "Sarito ho tsipika ny mariky ny tsipika."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Force Rules Legend (--force-rules-legend)"
msgstr "Terena ny fanazavan'ny fitsipika (--force-rules-legend)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Force the generation of HRULE and VRULE legends."
msgstr "Terena ny famoronana fanazavana ho an'ny HRULE sy VRULE."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Tab Width (--tabwidth &lt;pixels&gt;)"
msgstr "Sakan'ny tab (--tabwidth &lt;pixels&gt;)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "By default the tab-width is 40 pixels, use this option to change it."
msgstr "Amin'ny alalan'ny fandrindrana fototra dia 40 pikisela ny sakan'ny tab; ampiasao ity safidy ity hanovana izany."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Legend Position (--legend-position=&lt;position&gt;)"
msgstr "Toeran'ny fanazavana (--legend-position=&lt;position&gt;)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Place the legend at the given side of the graph."
msgstr "Apetraho eo amin'ny lafin'ny kisary voalaza ny fanazavana."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Legend Direction (--legend-direction=&lt;direction&gt;)"
msgstr "Fizotry ny fanazavana (--legend-direction=&lt;direction&gt;)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Place the legend items in the given vertical order."
msgstr "Alaharo araka ny filaharana mitsangana voalaza ireo singan'ny fanazavana."

#: include/global_form.php lib/api_aggregate.php
msgid "Graph Item Type"
msgstr "Karazana singan'ny kisary"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "How data for this item is represented visually on the graph."
msgstr "Fomba fanehoana hita maso ny angona ho an'ity singa ity eo amin'ny kisary."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "The data source to use for this graph item."
msgstr "Ny loharanon'angona ampiasaina amin'ity singan'ny kisary ity."

#: include/global_form.php lib/html.php
msgid "Primary Color"
msgstr "Loko voalohany"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "The color to use for the canvas item and legend."
msgstr "Ny loko ampiasaina amin'ny singan'ny kisary sy ny fanazavana."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Primary Opacity"
msgstr "Hamafin'ny loko voalohany"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "The opacity of the primary color."
msgstr "Ny hamafin'ny loko voalohany."

#: include/global_form.php lib/html.php
msgid "Gradient Color"
msgstr "Loko miova tsikelikely"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "The gradient color to use for the canvas item."
msgstr "Ny loko miova tsikelikely ampiasaina amin'ny singan'ny kisary."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Gradient Opacity"
msgstr "Hamafin'ny loko miova tsikelikely"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "The opacity of the gradient color."
msgstr "Ny hamafin'ny loko miova tsikelikely."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Gradient Height"
msgstr "Haavon'ny loko miova tsikelikely"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "The Gradient Height parameter can create three different behaviors. If it is > 0, then the gradient is a fixed height, starting at the line going down. If it is < 0, then the gradient starts at a fixed height above the x-axis, going down to the x-axis. If it is == 0, then the gradient goes from the top of the area fill to x-axis."
msgstr "Ny mari-pamantarana Haavon'ny loko miova tsikelikely dia afaka miteraka fomba fiasa telo samy hafa. Raha > 0 izy io, dia manana haavo raikitra ny fiovan'ny loko, manomboka eo amin'ny tsipika midina. Raha < 0 izy io, dia manomboka amin'ny haavo raikitra ambonin'ny teza x ny fiovan'ny loko, midina hatrany amin'ny teza x. Raha == 0 izy io, dia manomboka eo amin'ny tampony amin'ny faritra fenoina hatrany amin'ny teza x ny fiovan'ny loko."

#: include/global_form.php lib/rrd.php
msgid "Consolidation Function"
msgstr "Asa fanambarana"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "How data for this item is represented statistically on the graph."
msgstr "Fomba fanehoana ara-statistika ny angona ho an'ity singa ity eo amin'ny kisary."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "CDEF Function"
msgstr "Asa CDEF"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "A CDEF (math) function to apply to this item on the graph or legend."
msgstr "Asa CDEF (matematika) ampiharina amin'ity singa ity eo amin'ny kisary na fanazavana."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "VDEF Function"
msgstr "Asa VDEF"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "A VDEF (math) function to apply to this item on the graph legend."
msgstr "Asa VDEF (matematika) ampiharina amin'ity singa ity eo amin'ny fanazavan'ny kisary."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Shift Data"
msgstr "Fampifindrana angona"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Offset your data on the time axis (x-axis) by the amount specified in the 'value' field."
msgstr "Afindrao eo amin'ny tezan'ny fotoana (teza x) ny angonao araka ny sanda voafaritra ao amin'ny saha 'value'."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "[HRULE|VRULE]: The value of the graph item.<br/> [TICK]: The fraction for the tick line.<br/> [SHIFT]: The time offset in seconds."
msgstr "[HRULE|VRULE]: Ny sandan'ny singan'ny kisary.<br/> [TICK]: Ny ampahany ho an'ny tsipika marika.<br/> [SHIFT]: Ny elanelam-potoana amin'ny segondra."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "GPRINT Type"
msgstr "Karazana GPRINT"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "If this graph item is a GPRINT, you can optionally choose another format here. You can define additional types under \"GPRINT Presets\"."
msgstr "Raha GPRINT ity singan'ny kisary ity, dia azonao atao ny misafidy endrika hafa eto raha tiana. Azonao faritana ao amin'ny \"GPRINT Presets\" ny karazana fanampiny."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Text Alignment (TEXTALIGN)"
msgstr "Fandrindrana ny lahatsoratra (TEXTALIGN)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "All subsequent legend line(s) will be aligned as given here.  You may use this command multiple times in a single graph.  This command does not produce tabular layout.<br/><strong>Note: </strong>You may want to insert a &lt;HR&gt; on the preceding graph item.<br/> <strong>Note: </strong>A &lt;HR&gt; on this legend line will obsolete this setting!"
msgstr "Ny andalana fanazavana manaraka rehetra dia hampifanitsiana araka izay omena eto. Azonao ampiasaina imbetsaka amin'ny kisary iray ity baiko ity. Tsy mamorona endrika tabilao ity baiko ity.<br/><strong>Fanamarihana: </strong>Mety ho tianao ny mampiditra &lt;HR&gt; amin'ny singan'ny kisary teo aloha.<br/> <strong>Fanamarihana: </strong>Ny &lt;HR&gt; eo amin'ity andalana fanazavana ity dia hanafoana ity fandrindrana ity!"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Text Format"
msgstr "Endriky ny lahatsoratra"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Text that will be displayed on the legend for this graph item."
msgstr "Lahatsoratra haseho eo amin'ny fanazavana ho an'ity singan'ny kisary ity."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Legend for Export/Hover"
msgstr "Fanazavana ho an'ny fanondranana/fanondroana"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "A Legend to be displayed when Hovering over the Graph and also used for Graph Export.  Hover requires RRDtool 1.9.1 and above.  It may work for RRDtool 1.8+, but not for Thold Legends."
msgstr "Fanazavana haseho rehefa mandalo eo ambonin'ny kisary ary ampiasaina ihany koa amin'ny fanondranana kisary. Ny fanondroana dia mitaky RRDtool 1.9.1 no ho miakatra. Mety handeha amin'ny RRDtool 1.8+, fa tsy ho an'ny Thold Legends."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Insert Hard Return"
msgstr "Ampidiro fiverenana an-dalana raikitra"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Forces the legend to the next line after this item."
msgstr "Manery ny fanazavana hidina amin'ny andalana manaraka aorian'ity singa ity."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Line Width (decimal)"
msgstr "Sakan'ny tsipika (desimaly)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "In case LINE was chosen, specify width of line here.  You must include a decimal precision, for example 2.00"
msgstr "Raha LINE no voafidy, farito eto ny sakan'ny tsipika. Tsy maintsy mampiditra isa misy faingo ianao, ohatra 2.00"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Dashes (dashes[=on_s[,off_s[,on_s,off_s]...]])"
msgstr "Tsipika tapaka (dashes[=on_s[,off_s[,on_s,off_s]...]])"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "The dashes modifier enables dashed line style."
msgstr "Ny mpanova dashes dia mampandeha ny fomba tsipika tapaka."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Dash Offset (dash-offset=offset)"
msgstr "Fikisahana tsipika tapaka (dash-offset=offset)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "The dash-offset parameter specifies an offset into the pattern at which the stroke begins."
msgstr "Ny masontsivana dash-offset dia mamaritra ny fikisahana ao amin'ny lamina izay anombohan'ny tsipika."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "The name given to this graph template."
msgstr "Ny anarana nomena ity lasitry ny kisary ity."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "The Class of this Graph Template."
msgstr "Ny sokajin'ity lasitry ny kisary ity."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "The Version given to this Graph Template."
msgstr "Ny kinova nomena ity lasitry ny kisary ity."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Multiple Instances"
msgstr "Endrika maromaro"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Check this checkbox if there can be more than one Graph of this type per Device."
msgstr "Mariho ity boaty ity raha toa ka azo atao ny manana kisary mihoatra ny iray amin'ity karazana ity isaky ny fitaovana."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Test Data Sources"
msgstr "Fitsapana ny loharanon'angona"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Check this checkbox if you wish to test the Data Sources prior to their creation.  With Test Data Sources enabled, if the Data Source does not return valid data, the Graph will not be created.  This setting is important if you wish to have a more generic Device Template that can include more Graph Templates that can be selectively applied depending on the characteristics of the Device itself.  Note: If you have a long running script as a Data Source, the time to create Graphs will be increased."
msgstr "Mariho ity boaty ity raha te hitsapa ny loharanon'angona alohan'ny hamoronana azy ianao. Rehefa alefa ny Fitsapana ny loharanon'angona, raha tsy mamerina angona manankery ny loharanon'angona dia tsy ho noforonina ny kisary. Zava-dehibe ity fanovana ity raha te hanana lasitry ny fitaovana ankapobeny kokoa ianao izay ahitana lasitry ny kisary maro kokoa azo ampiharina arakaraka ny toetran'ny fitaovana tsirairay. Fanamarihana: Raha manana sora-baiko maharitra ela ianao ho loharanon'angona, dia hihalava ny fotoana hamoronana kisary."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Enter a name for this graph item input, make sure it is something you recognize."
msgstr "Ampidiro ny anarana ho an'ity fampidirana singan-kisary ity, ataovy azo antoka fa zavatra fantatrao izany."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Enter a description for this graph item input to describe what this input is used for."
msgstr "Ampidiro ny famaritana ho an'ity fampidirana singan-kisary ity mba hilazana ny antony ampiasana azy."

