msgstr "Anaran'ny mpampiantrano feno na adiresy IP ho an'ity fitaovana ity. Ampidiro ao anaty fonon-teny mahitsy ny adiresy IPv6 (ohatra: [2001:abcd:1234::1])"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "The physical location of the Device.  This free-form text can be a room, rack location, etc."
