#: include/global_form.php
msgid "The method Cacti will use to determine if a host is available for polling.  <br><i>NOTE: It is recommended that, at a minimum, SNMP always be selected.</i>"
msgstr "Ny fomba hampiasain'ny Cacti hamaritana raha vonona hangonina angona ny mpampiantrano iray. <br><i>FANAMARIHANA: Amporisihina ny hisafidianana ny SNMP farafahakeliny hatrany.</i>"

