msgstr "Raha tsy mandeha ny fitaovana iray, ampiasao ity andian-tsafidy SNMP ity mba hanandramana hamerina ny fifandraisana amin'ny fitaovana sy hanavao ny fanovan'ny fitaovana mifototra amin'ny andian-tsafidy SNMP mifanaraka voalohany."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "The type of ping packet to send.  <br><i>NOTE: ICMP on Linux/UNIX requires root privileges.</i>  <br><i>NOTE: TCP Ping Closed - Even if the tcp ping is not successful, the device can be considered UP.</i>"
msgstr "Ny karazana fonosan-drakitra ping halefa. <br><i>FANAMARIHANA: Ny ICMP amin'ny Linux/UNIX dia mitaky alalana root.</i> <br><i>FANAMARIHANA: TCP Ping Closed - Na dia tsy mahomby aza ny tcp ping dia azo heverina ho mandeha (UP) ny fitaovana.</i>"

