#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Inline JavaScript Protection"
msgstr "Fiarovana JavaScript Anaty Pejy"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Controls how the Content-Security-Policy restricts inline JavaScript.  HTMX keeps the 'unsafe-inline' policy that all current themes and plugins rely on and matches the behaviour of prior releases.  Nonce Migration emits a strict nonce policy in report-only mode so incompatible core and plugin scripts can be identified without breaking the UI.  Nonce Enforcement blocks scripts without the request nonce and requires CACTI_CSP_NONCE_ENFORCE to be true in include/config.php; without that explicit gate it safely remains in report-only mode.  None also permits unsafe eval() calls and is the least restrictive option."
msgstr "Mifehy ny fomba famerana ny JavaScript anatiny ataon'ny Content-Security-Policy. Ny HTMX dia mitazona ny politika 'unsafe-inline' izay iankinan'ny lohahevitra sy ny plugin rehetra ankehitriny ary mifanaraka amin'ny fiasan'ny dikan-teny teo aloha. Ny Fifindrana Nonce dia mamoaka politika nonce hentitra amin'ny fomba tatitra ihany mba hahafahana mamantatra ireo script fototra sy plugin tsy mifanaraka nefa tsy manimba ny UI. Ny Fampiharana Nonce dia manakana ireo script tsy manana ny nonce-n'ny fangatahana ary mitaky ny maha-true ny CACTI_CSP_NONCE_ENFORCE ao amin'ny include/config.php; raha tsy misy io famerana mazava io dia mijanona am-pilaminana amin'ny fomba tatitra ihany izy. Ny Tsy misy (None) dia mamela ihany koa ny fiantsoana eval() tsy azo antoka ary io no safidy malalaka indrindra."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "HTMX (Default)"
msgstr "HTMX (Safidy fototra)"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Nonce Migration (Report Only)"
msgstr "Fifindrana Nonce (Tatitra ihany)"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Nonce Enforcement (Advanced)"
msgstr "Fampiharana Nonce (Avo lenta)"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "CSP Violation Report URI"
msgstr "URI tatitra fandikana ny CSP"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Used in Nonce Migration and Nonce Enforcement modes.  URL where browsers post Content-Security-Policy violation reports.  Leave blank to use the bundled csp_report.php handler under the configured Cacti URL path."
msgstr "Ampiasaina amin'ny fomba Fifindrana Nonce sy Fampiharana Nonce. URL andefasan'ny mpitety tranonkala ny tatitra fandikana ny Content-Security-Policy. Avelao ho foana raha hampiasa ny mpitantana csp_report.php miaraka aminy eo ambanin'ny lalan'ny URL Cacti voarindra."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Content-Security Alternate Sources"
msgstr "Loharano hafa ho an'ny Content-Security"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Space-delimited domain names that will be permitted to be accessed outside of the Web Server itself.  This is important for users choosing to use a CDN, or hosting site.  Sources can include wildcards for example: *.mydomain.com, or a protocol, for example: https://*.example.com.  These Alternate Sources include Image, CSS and JavaScript types only."
msgstr "Anaran-tsehatra sarahan'ny elanelana izay avela hidirana ivelan'ny mpizara tranonkala mihitsy. Zava-dehibe izany ho an'ny mpampiasa misafidy ny hampiasa CDN, na toeram-pampiantranoana. Ny loharano dia mety ahitana marika solon-tena ohatra: *.mydomain.com, na prôtôkôly, ohatra: https://*.example.com. Ireo Loharano hafa ireo dia tsy ahitana afa-tsy karazana Sary, CSS ary JavaScript ihany."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enable htmx for in-place filter updates"
msgstr "Alefa ny htmx ho an'ny fanavaozana sivana eo an-toerana"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When enabled, the htmx loader is included so pages that opt in can refresh their filter results without a full page reload. Disable only if plugins misbehave."
msgstr "Rehefa alefa dia ampidirina ny mpampiditra htmx mba hahafahan'ny pejy misafidy izany manavao ny vokatry ny sivana nefa tsy mila mamerina mandefa ny pejy manontolo. Ajanony raha tsy mandeha tsara ny plugin ihany."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "On (default)"
msgstr "Alefa (mahazatra)"

#: include/global_settings.php support.php
msgid "Off"
msgstr "Tsy alefa"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Remote Agent"
msgstr "Agent lavitra"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When using multiple Data Collectors, there are the Settings for Communicating between Data Collectors"
msgstr "Rehefa mampiasa Mpanangona angona maromaro dia ireto ny Fandrindrana fifandraisana eo amin'ny Mpanangona angona"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "TCP Port"
msgstr "Seranana TCP"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The TCP Port used for communicating with the Remote Data Collectors.  The protocol will match the Central Cacti web server (either HTTP or HTTPS).  Leave blank to use the default ports."
msgstr "Ny Seranana TCP ampiasaina hifandraisana amin'ny Mpanangona angona lavitra. Ny prôtôkôly dia hifanaraka amin'ny mpizara tranonkala Cacti foibe (na HTTP na HTTPS). Avelao ho foana raha hampiasa ny seranana mahazatra."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The amount of time, in seconds, that the Central Cacti web server will wait for a response from the Remote Data Collector to obtain various Device information before abandoning the request.  On Devices that are associated with Data Collectors other than the Central Cacti Data Collector, the Remote Agent must be used to gather Device information."
msgstr "Ny fe-potoana, amin'ny segondra, hiandrasan'ny mpizara tranonkala Cacti foibe ny valiny avy amin'ny Mpanangona angona lavitra mba hahazoana fampahalalana isan-karazany momba ny Fitaovana alohan'ny hanajanonana ny fangatahana. Amin'ireo Fitaovana mifandray amin'ny Mpanangona angona hafa ankoatra ny Mpanangona angona Cacti foibe dia tsy maintsy ampiasaina ny Agent lavitra mba hanangonana ny fampahalalana momba ny Fitaovana."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Verify Remote Agent TLS Certificates"
msgstr "Fanamarinana ny mari-pankatoavana TLS an'ny Agent lavitra"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Require a trusted certificate whose name matches the Remote Data Collector hostname. Disable only while replacing legacy self-signed certificates."
msgstr "Mitaky mari-pankatoavana azo itokisana izay mifanaraka amin'ny anaran'ny mpampiantrano an'ny Mpanangona angona lavitra ny anarany. Ajanony raha eo am-panoloana ireo mari-pankatoavana nosoniavin'ny tenany taloha ihany."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "No (Legacy Self-signed Certificate)"
msgstr "Tsia (Mari-pankatoavana nosoniavin'ny tenany taloha)"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Remote Agent CA File"
msgstr "Rakitra CA an'ny Agent lavitra"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Optional absolute path to a PEM CA bundle used to verify Remote Data Collector certificates. Leave blank to use the PHP/OpenSSL system trust store."
msgstr "Lalana feno tsy voatery ho an'ny taharo PEM CA ampiasaina hanamarinana ny mari-pankatoavan'ny Mpanangona angona lavitra. Avelao ho foana raha hampiasa ny tahirim-pitokisan'ny rafitra PHP/OpenSSL."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Logging Level"
msgstr "Ambaratongan'ny firaketana"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The Logging level for Automation activities.  Levels are Low, Medium and High."
msgstr "Ny ambaratongan'ny firaketana ho an'ny asan'ny Fandehanana ho azy. Ny ambaratonga dia Ambany, Antonony ary Avo."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Force Serial Automation Scans"
msgstr "Terena ny fitiliana milahatra amin'ny Fandehanana ho azy"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When enabled, Cacti Automation will scan one network at a time not in Parallel.  This setting can be useful when your Cacti Web Servers have limited cores for performing Automation checks."
msgstr "Rehefa alefa dia hitily tambajotra iray isaky ny mandeha ny Fandehanana ho azy Cacti fa tsy miaraka. Mety hilaina io fandrindrana io rehefa voafetra ny isan'ny foiben-kajy amin'ny Mpizara tranonkala Cacti anao hanaovana ny fanamarinana Fandehanana ho azy."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enable Automatic Graph Creation"
msgstr "Alefa ny famoronana kisary ho azy"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When disabled, Cacti Automation will not actively create any Graph.  This is useful when adjusting Device settings so as to avoid creating new Graphs each time you save an object.  Invoking Automation Rules manually will still be possible."
msgstr "Rehefa tsy alefa dia tsy hamorona kisary mivantana ny Fandehanana ho azy Cacti. Ilaina izany rehefa manitsy ny fandrindrana Fitaovana mba hisorohana ny famoronana kisary vaovao isaky ny mitahiry zavatra iray ianao. Mbola azo atao ihany ny miantso ny Fitsipika Fandehanana ho azy amin'ny tanana."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enable Automatic Tree Item Creation"
msgstr "Alefa ny famoronana singa hazo ho azy"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When disabled, Cacti Automation will not actively create any Tree Item.  This is useful when adjusting Device or Graph settings so as to avoid creating new Tree Entries each time you save an object.  Invoking Rules manually will still be possible."
msgstr "Rehefa tsy alefa dia tsy hamorona singa hazo mivantana ny Fandehanana ho azy Cacti. Ilaina izany rehefa manitsy ny fandrindrana Fitaovana na Kisary mba hisorohana ny famoronana fampidirana hazo vaovao isaky ny mitahiry zavatra iray ianao. Mbola azo atao ihany ny miantso ny Fitsipika amin'ny tanana."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Automation Notification To Email"
msgstr "Mailaka handefasana ny fampandrenesana Fandehanana ho azy"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The Email Address to send Automation Notification Emails to if not specified at the Automation Network level.  If either this field, or the Automation Network value are left blank, Cacti will use the Primary Cacti Admins Email account."
msgstr "Ny adiresy mailaka handefasana ny mailaka fampandrenesana Fandehanana ho azy raha tsy voafaritra eo amin'ny ambaratongan'ny Tambajotra Fandehanana ho azy. Raha avela ho foana na ity saha ity na ny sandan'ny Tambajotra Fandehanana ho azy, dia hampiasa ny kaonty mailaky ny Mpitantana Cacti voalohany ny Cacti."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Automation Notification From Name"
msgstr "Anaran'ny mpandefa ny fampandrenesana Fandehanana ho azy"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The Email Name to use for Automation Notification Emails to if not specified at the Automation Network level.  If either this field, or the Automation Network value are left blank, Cacti will use the system default From Name."
msgstr "Ny anarana mailaka ampiasaina amin'ny mailaka fampandrenesana Fandehanana ho azy raha tsy voafaritra eo amin'ny ambaratongan'ny Tambajotra Fandehanana ho azy. Raha avela ho foana na ity saha ity na ny sandan'ny Tambajotra Fandehanana ho azy, dia hampiasa ny Anaran'ny mpandefa mahazatra ao amin'ny rafitra ny Cacti."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Automation Notification From Email"
msgstr "Mailaky ny mpandefa ny fampandrenesana Fandehanana ho azy"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The Email Address to use for Automation Notification Emails to if not specified at the Automation Network level.  If either this field, or the Automation Network value are left blank, Cacti will use the system default From Email Address."
msgstr "Ny adiresy mailaka ampiasaina amin'ny mailaka fampandrenesan'ny Fampandehanana ho azy raha tsy voatondro eo amin'ny ambaratongan'ny Tambajotran'ny fampandehanana ho azy. Raha avela ho banga na ity saha ity na ny sandan'ny Tambajotran'ny fampandehanana ho azy, dia hampiasa ny adiresy mailaka mpandefa lasitra an'ny rafitra ny Cacti."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Graph Template Defaults"
msgstr "Sanda voafaritra mialoha ho an'ny môdelin-kisary"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Graph Template Test Data Source"
msgstr "Fitsapana ny loharanon'angona ho an'ny môdelin-kisary"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Check this checkbox if you wish to test the Data Sources prior to their creation for new and newly imported Graph Templates.  With Test Data Sources enabled, if the Data Source does not return valid data, the Graph will not be created.  This setting is important if you wish to have a more generic Device Template that can include more Graph Templates that can be selectively applied depending on the characteristics of the Device itself.  Note: If you have a long running script as a Data Source, the time to create Graphs will be increased."
msgstr "Mariho ity boaty fikosehana ity raha te hitsapa ny Loharanon'angona alohan'ny famoronana azy ianao ho an'ireo Môdelin-kisary vaovao sy vao nafarana. Rehefa alefa ny Fitsapana loharanon'angona, raha tsy mamerina angona manankery ny Loharanon'angona, dia tsy ho voaforona ny Kisary. Zava-dehibe ity fanamboarana ity raha maniry hanana Môdelim-pitaovana ankapobeny kokoa izay afaka ahitana Môdelin-kisary maromaro azo ampiharina arakaraka ny toetran'ny Fitaovana ianao. Fanamarihana: Raha manana script maharitra ela ianao amin'ny maha-Loharanon'angona azy, dia hitombo ny fotoana hamoronana ny Kisary."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The default Image Format to be used for all new Graph Templates."
msgstr "Ny endriky ny sary voafaritra mialoha ampiasaina amin'ireo Môdelin-kisary vaovao rehetra."

#: include/global_settings.php
