msgid "Default SNMPv3 Privacy Passphrase for all new Devices."
msgstr "Andian-tenimiafina tsiambaratelo SNMP v3 voafaritra mialoha ho an'ireo Fitaovana vaovao rehetra."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enter the SNMP v3 Context for all new Devices."
msgstr "Ampidiro ny Tontolo (Context) SNMP v3 ho an'ireo Fitaovana vaovao rehetra."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Default SNMP v3 Engine Id for all new Devices. Leave this field empty to use the SNMP Engine ID being defined per SNMPv3 Notification receiver."
msgstr "Famantarana Engine ID SNMP v3 voafaritra mialoha ho an'ireo Fitaovana vaovao rehetra. Avelao ho banga ity saha ity mba hampiasa ny SNMP Engine ID voafaritra isaky ny mpandray fampandrenesana SNMPv3."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Port Number"
msgstr "Laharan'ny seranana"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Default UDP Port for all new Devices.  Typically 161."
msgstr "Seranana UDP voafaritra mialoha ho an'ireo Fitaovana vaovao rehetra. Matetika 161."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Default SNMP timeout in milli-seconds for all new Devices."
msgstr "Fe-potoana farany SNMP amin'ny milisegondra voafaritra mialoha ho an'ireo Fitaovana vaovao rehetra."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "must be a positive integer (milliseconds)."
msgstr "tsy maintsy isa feno miabo (milisegondra)."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "must be between {{ min }} and {{ max }}."
msgstr "tsy maintsy eo anelanelan'ny {{ min }} sy {{ max }}."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Default SNMP retries for all new Devices."
msgstr "Isan'ny fiezahana indray SNMP voafaritra mialoha ho an'ireo Fitaovana vaovao rehetra."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "must be a non-negative integer."
msgstr "tsy maintsy isa feno tsy miiba."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "SNMP Behavior"
msgstr "Fomba fiasan'ny SNMP"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "SNMP Agent Support Enabled"
msgstr "Fanohanana SNMP Agent alefa"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If this option is checked, Cacti will populate SNMP Agent tables with Cacti device and system information.  It does not enable the SNMP Agent itself."
msgstr "Raha voamarika ity safidy ity, dia hameno ny tabilaon'ny SNMP Agent amin'ny mombamomba ny fitaovana sy ny rafitra Cacti ny Cacti. Tsy mandefa ny SNMP Agent mihitsy izany."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enable MD5 and DES for SNMPv3"
msgstr "Alefaso ny MD5 sy DES ho an'ny SNMPv3"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The MD5 authentication and DES privacy algorithms are legacy, weak, and unavailable on hardened (FIPS) PHP and Net-SNMP builds.  When disabled, MD5 and DES are removed from the SNMPv3 Authentication and Privacy Protocol dropdowns shown when editing a Device and in the Automation SNMP Options, leaving only the stronger SHA and AES algorithms."
msgstr "Efa tranainy, malemy, ary tsy hita amin'ireo PHP sy Net-SNMP nohamafisina (FIPS) ny algôritma fanamarinana MD5 sy tsiambaratelo DES. Rehefa tsy alefa, dia esorina ao amin'ny lisitra fidina ho an'ny Prôtôkôly fanamarinana sy tsiambaratelo SNMPv3 aseho rehefa manova Fitaovana sy ao amin'ny Safidy SNMP amin'ny Fampandehanana ho azy ny MD5 sy DES, ka ny algôritma SHA sy AES matanjaka kokoa ihany no tavela."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enable Credential Cache"
msgstr "Alefaso ny fitahirizana vonjimaika ny mari-panamarinana"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Pre-harden and cache SNMPv3 credential arguments once per credential change so each poller process reuses them instead of rebuilding them on every request.  This yields a marginal savings when collecting with SNMPv3 credentials through the Net-SNMP binaries.  The php-snmp extension handles most SNMPv3 gets in-process and bypasses this cache, but the Net-SNMP binaries (and therefore this cache) are still used for SNMP walks, hex output, requests that set a context or engine id, and protocol combinations that the running PHP version does not support.  Enable this if you collect any of those workloads with SNMPv3 credentials."
msgstr "Hamafiso mialoha ary tehirizo vonjimaika indray mandeha isaky ny fanovana mari-panamarinana ireo mari-pamantarana SNMPv3 mba hampiasan'ny fizotran'ny poller tsirairay azy indray fa tsy hanamboarana azy amin'ny fangatahana rehetra. Mitondra fitsitsiana kely izany rehefa manangona angona amin'ny mari-panamarinana SNMPv3 amin'ny alalan'ny rakitra azo tanterahina Net-SNMP. Ny fanitarana php-snmp dia mitantana ny ankamaroan'ny fangatahana get SNMPv3 ao anatiny ihany ary mandingana ity fitahirizana vonjimaika ity, saingy mbola ampiasaina ihany ny rakitra azo tanterahina Net-SNMP (ary noho izany ity fitahirizana vonjimaika ity) ho an'ny SNMP walk, vokatra hex, fangatahana mametraka context na engine id, ary fitambarana prôtôkôly tsy tohanan'ny kinova PHP mandeha. Alefaso ity raha manangona iray amin'ireo asa ireo amin'ny mari-panamarinana SNMPv3 ianao."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Max OID Limit"
msgstr "Fetra ambony indrindra amin'ny OID"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The default maximum number of SNMP Get OIDs to issue per snmpget request.  For Devices, this setting is controlled at the Device level.  You should only use this setting when using Cacti's SNMP API natively in your scripts or plugins."
msgstr "Ny isa ambony indrindra voafaritra mialoha amin'ny SNMP Get OIDs halefa isaky ny fangatahana snmpget. Ho an'ny Fitaovana, io fanamboarana io dia fehezina eo amin'ny ambaratongan'ny Fitaovana. Tsy tokony hampiasa ity fanamboarana ity ianao raha tsy mampiasa mivantana ny API SNMP an'ny Cacti ao amin'ny script na plugin-nao."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Bulkwalk Fetch Size"
msgstr "Haben'ny fakana Bulkwalk"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "How many OID's should be returned per snmpbulkwalk request?  For Devices with large SNMP trees, increasing this size will increase re-index performance over a WAN."
msgstr "Firy ny OID tokony haverina isaky ny fangatahana snmpbulkwalk? Ho an'ny Fitaovana manana hazo SNMP lehibe, ny fampitomboana izany habe izany dia hampitombo ny fahombiazan'ny famerenana fanondroana amin'ny tambajotra WAN."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Disable increasing OID Check"
msgstr "Atsaharo ny fanamarinana ny fitomboan'ny OID"

