#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Refresh Poller Table Per Cycle"
msgstr "Fanavaozana ny tabilaon'ny Poller isaky ny tsingerina"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This setting is for a single poller systems only to rebuild the poller output table on each polling cycle to prevent the memory table from swapping on very large systems with large databases that could use swap."
msgstr "Ity fandrindrana ity dia natao ho an'ny rafitra manana poller tokana ihany mba hananganana indray ny tabilaon'ny vokatry ny poller amin'ny tsingerina fanangonana tsirairay mba hisorohana ny tabilaon'ny fitadidiana tsy hampiasa swap amin'ny rafitra lehibe dia lehibe manana angon-drakitra lehibe izay mety hampiasa swap."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Data Collector Replication"
msgstr "Fampitoviana ny mpanangona angona"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Poller Sync Interval"
msgstr "Elanelam-potoana fampifanarahana ny Poller"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The default polling sync interval to use when creating a poller.  This setting will affect how often remote pollers are checked and updated."
msgstr "Ny elanelam-potoana fampifanarahana fanangonana voafaritra mialoha ampiasaina rehefa mamorona poller.  Hisy fiantraikany amin'ny fahatetehan'ny fanamarinana sy fanavaozana ny poller lavitra ity fandrindrana ity."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Disable Resource Cache Replication"
msgstr "Atsaharo ny fampitoviana ny Cache-n'ny loharano"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "By default, the main Cacti Data Collector will cache the entire web site and plugins into a Resource Cache.  Then, periodically the Remote Data Collectors will update themselves with any updates from the main Cacti Data Collector.  This Resource Cache essentially allows Remote Data Collectors to self upgrade.  If you do not wish to use this option, you can disable it using this setting."
msgstr "Amin'ny alalan'ny fandrindrana fototra, ny Mpanangona angona fototra Cacti dia hitahiry ny tranonkala manontolo sy ny plugins ao amin'ny Tahiry loharano. Avy eo, manavao ny tenany tsindraindray amin'ny fanavaozana rehetra avy amin'ny Mpanangona angona fototra Cacti ireo Mpanangona angona lavitra. Ity Tahiry loharano ity dia mamela ny Mpanangona angona lavitra hanavao ny tenany ho azy. Raha tsy te hampiasa ity safidy ity ianao dia azonao atao ny manafoana azy amin'ny alalan'ity fandrindrana ity."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Disable Automatic Full Sync on Upgrade"
msgstr "Atsaharo ny fampifanarahana feno mandeha ho azy mandritra ny fanavaozana"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "By default, upon upgrading the Main Cacti system, it will perform a Full Sync to all Data Collectors.  This process may be time consuming.  Therefore, to allow upgrades to be completed quicker, we provide this option.  Note that if this is disabled, the Cacti administrator must force this process from the Data Collectors interface after upgrade."
msgstr "Amin'ny alalan'ny fandrindrana fototra, rehefa manavao ny rafitra Cacti fototra dia manatanteraka Fampifanarahana feno amin'ny Mpanangona angona rehetra izy. Mety handany fotoana ity dingana ity. Noho izany, mba hahafahana mamita haingana kokoa ny fanavaozana dia manolotra ity safidy ity izahay. Mariho fa raha ajanona ity safidy ity, dia tsy maintsy manery ity dingana ity avy ao amin'ny seha-pifandraisana Mpanangona angona ny mpitantana Cacti aorian'ny fanavaozana."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Additional Data Collector Settings"
msgstr "Fandrindrana fanampiny ho an'ny Mpanangona angona"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Invalid Data Logging"
msgstr "Firaketana angona tsy manan-kery"

#: include/global_settings.php
