msgid "The number of concurrent script server processes to run per spine process.  Settings between 1 and 15 are accepted.  This parameter will help if you are running several threads and script server scripts and is only valid for the spine Data Collector."
msgstr "Ny isan'ny dingan'ny mpizara script mandeha miaraka alefa isaky ny dingana spine. Ekena ny sanda eo anelanelan'ny 1 sy 15. Hanampy ity masontsivana ity raha mampandeha kofehy (threads) sy script mpizara script maromaro ianao, ary tsy manan-kery afa-tsy ho an'ny Mpanangona angona spine ihany."

