#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Authentication Method"
msgstr "Fomba fanamarinana maha-izy azy"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "<blockquote><i>Built-in Authentication</i> - Cacti handles user authentication, which allows you to create users and give them rights to different areas within Cacti.<br><br><i>Web Basic Authentication</i> - Authentication is handled by the web server. Users can be added or created automatically on first login if the Template User is defined, otherwise the defined guest permissions will be used.<br><br><i>LDAP Authentication</i> - Allows for authentication against a LDAP server. Users will be created automatically on first login if the Template User is defined, otherwise the defined guest permissions will be used.  If PHPs LDAP module is not enabled, LDAP Authentication will not appear as a selectable option.<br><br><i>Multiple LDAP/AD Domain Authentication</i> - Allows administrators to support multiple disparate groups from different LDAP/AD directories to access Cacti resources.  Just as LDAP Authentication, the PHP LDAP module is required to utilize this method.</blockquote>"
msgstr "<blockquote><i>Fanamarinana ao anatiny</i> - I Cacti no mitantana ny fanamarinana ny mpampiasa, izay ahafahanao mamorona mpampiasa sy manome azy ireo alalana amin'ny faritra samihafa ao amin'ny Cacti.<br><br><i>Fanamarinana fototra Web</i> - Ny mpizara web no mitantana ny fanamarinana. Azo ampidirina na foronina ho azy ny mpampiasa amin'ny fidirana voalohany raha voafaritra ny Mpampiasa Lasitra, raha tsy izany dia ny alalan'ny vahiny voafaritra no ampiasaina.<br><br><i>Fanamarinana LDAP</i> - Ahafahana manamarina amin'ny alalan'ny mpizara LDAP. Hoforonina ho azy ny mpampiasa amin'ny fidirana voalohany raha voafaritra ny Mpampiasa Lasitra, raha tsy izany dia ny alalan'ny vahiny voafaritra no ampiasaina. Raha tsy mandeha ny maodely LDAP an'ny PHP dia tsy hiseho ho safidy azo fidina ny Fanamarinana LDAP.<br><br><i>Fanamarinana sehatra LDAP/AD maromaro</i> - Ahafahan'ny mpitantana manohana vondrona samihafa avy amin'ny lahatahiry LDAP/AD samy hafa hiditra amin'ny loharanon'ny Cacti. Tahaka ny Fanamarinana LDAP ihany, ilaina ny maodely LDAP an'ny PHP mba hampiasana ity fomba ity.</blockquote>"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Support Authentication Cookies"
msgstr "Manohana cookie fanamarinana"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If a user authenticates and selects 'Keep me signed in', an authentication cookie will be created on the user's computer allowing that user to stay logged in.  The authentication cookie expires after 90 days of non-use.  Note, the client must use HTTPS to leverage this feature."
msgstr "Raha manao fanamarinana ny mpampiasa iray ary misafidy ny 'Tazomy hiditra hatrany aho', dia hisy cookie fanamarinana hoforonina ao amin'ny solosainan'ny mpampiasa izay ahafahany mijanona ho tafiditra. Tapitra ny fetran'ny cookie fanamarinana rehefa tsy ampiasaina mandritra ny 90 andro. Mariho fa tsy maintsy mampiasa HTTPS ny mpanjifa mba hampiasana ity endri-javatra ity."

