msgstr "Isan'ny rakitra tsy an-tserasera:"

#: index.php
msgid "<strong>NOTE:</strong> You are logged into a Remote Data Collector.  When <b>'online'</b>, you will be able to view and control much of the Main Cacti Web Site just as if you were logged into it.  Also, it's important to note that Remote Data Collectors are required to use the Cacti's Performance Boosting Services <b>'On Demand Updating'</b> feature, and we always recommend using Spine.  When the Remote Data Collector is <b>'offline'</b>, the Remote Data Collectors Web Site will contain much less information.  However, it will cache all updates until the Main Cacti Database and Web Server are reachable.  Then it will dump it's Boost table output back to the Main Cacti Database for updating."
msgstr "<strong>FANAMARIHANA:</strong> Tafiditra ao amin'ny Mpanangona Angona Lavitra ianao. Rehefa <b>'an-tserasera'</b> izy dia ho afaka mijery sy mifehy ny ankamaroan'ny Tranonkala Fototra Cacti ianao toy ny hoe tafiditra ao aminy. Ankoatra izany, zava-dehibe ny manamarika fa ny Mpanangona Angona Lavitra dia takiana hampiasa ny endri-javatra <b>'Fanavaozana araka ny fangatahana'</b> an'ny Sampan-draharaha Fanatsarana Fahombiazan'ny Cacti, ary manoro hevitra hatrany izahay ny hampiasa Spine. Rehefa <b>'tsy an-tserasera'</b> ny Mpanangona Angona Lavitra dia ho vitsy lavitra ny fampahalalana ao amin'ny Tranonkalan'ny Mpanangona Angona Lavitra. Na izany aza, hitahiry vonjimaika ny fanavaozana rehetra izy mandra-pahatongan'ny Banky Angona Fototra Cacti sy ny Mpizara Tranonkala ho azo idirana. Avy eo dia handefa ny vokatra avy amin'ny tabilao Boost miverina any amin'ny Banky Angona Fototra Cacti izy mba hanaovana fanavaozana."

#: index.php
msgid "<strong>NOTE:</strong> None of the Core Cacti Plugins, to date, have been re-designed to work with Remote Data Collectors.  Therefore, Plugins such as MacTrack, and HMIB, which require direct access to devices will not work with Remote Data Collectors at this time.  However, plugins such as Thold will work so long as the Remote Data Collector is in <b>'online'</b> mode."
msgstr "<strong>FANAMARIHANA:</strong> Hatramin'izao, tsy mbola nisy tamin'ireo Plugin Fototra Cacti no namboarina indray mba hiasa miaraka amin'ny Mpanangona Angona Lavitra. Noho izany, ireo Plugin toy ny MacTrack sy HMIB, izay mitaky fidirana mivantana amin'ny fitaovana, dia tsy hiasa miaraka amin'ny Mpanangona Angona Lavitra amin'izao fotoana izao. Na izany aza, ireo plugin toy ny Thold dia hiasa raha mbola ao amin'ny fomba <b>'an-tserasera'</b> ny Mpanangona Angona Lavitra."

