#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Cacti requires several PHP Modules to be installed to work properly. If any of these are not installed, you will be unable to continue the installation until corrected. In addition, for optimal system performance Cacti should be run with certain MySQL system variables set.  Please follow the MySQL recommendations at your discretion.  Always seek the MySQL documentation if you have any questions."
msgstr "Mitaky maody PHP maromaro napetraka ny Cacti mba hiasa tsara. Raha misy amin'ireo tsy tafapetraka dia tsy ho afaka hanohy ny fametrahana ianao mandra-pahavitany. Ankoatra izany, ho an'ny fahombiazan'ny rafitra tsara indrindra dia tokony hampandehanana miaraka amin'ny fari-drafitra MySQL sasany voafaritra ny Cacti. Araho araka ny safidinao ny tolo-kevitry ny MySQL. Jereo hatrany ny antontan-taratasin'ny MySQL raha manana fanontaniana ianao."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "The following PHP extensions are mandatory, and MUST be installed before continuing your Cacti install."
msgstr "Tsy maintsy ilaina ireto fanitarana PHP manaraka ireto, ary TSY MAINTSY apetraka alohan'ny hanohizana ny fametrahana ny Cacti."

