#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Your MySQL TimeZone database is not populated.  Please populate this database before proceeding."
msgstr "Tsy misy angona ny angon-drakitry ny faritra ora MySQL anao. Fenoy azafady io angon-drakitra io alohan'ny hanohizana."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Your Cacti database login account does not have access to the MySQL TimeZone database.  Please provide the Cacti database account \"select\" access to the \"time_zone_name\" table in the \"mysql\" database, and populate MySQL's TimeZone information before proceeding."
msgstr "Tsy manana fidirana amin'ny angon-drakitry ny faritra ora MySQL ny kaonty fidirana amin'ny angon-drakitra Cacti anao. Omeo alalana \"select\" ao amin'ny tabilao \"time_zone_name\" ao amin'ny angon-drakitra \"mysql\" ny kaontin'ny angon-drakitra Cacti, ary fenoy ny fampahalalana momba ny faritra oran'ny MySQL alohan'ny hanohizana."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Your Cacti database account has access to the MySQL TimeZone database and that database is populated with global TimeZone information."
msgstr "Manana fidirana amin'ny angon-drakitry ny faritra ora MySQL ny kaontin'ny angon-drakitra Cacti anao ary feno fampahalalana momba ny faritra ora maneran-tany io angon-drakitra io."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "MySQL - Settings"
msgstr "MySQL - Fikirana"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "These MySQL performance tuning settings will help your Cacti system perform better without issues for a longer time."
msgstr "Ireo fikirana fanatsarana ny fahombiazan'ny MySQL ireo dia hanampy ny rafitra Cacti anao hiasa tsara kokoa tsy misy olana mandritra ny fotoana maharitra."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Recommended MySQL System Variable Settings"
msgstr "Fikirana fari-drafitra MySQL atolotra"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Installation Type"
msgstr "Karazam-pametrahana"

#: lib/installer.php
#, php-format
msgid "Upgrade from <strong>%s</strong> to <strong>%s</strong>"
msgstr "Fanavaozana avy amin'ny <strong>%1$s</strong> mankany amin'ny <strong>%2$s</strong>"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "In the event of issues, It is highly recommended that you clear your browser cache, closing then reopening your browser (not just the tab Cacti is on) and retrying, before raising an issue with The Cacti Group"
msgstr "Raha sendra misy olana dia asaina mafy ianao hamafa ny tahirin'ny mpitety tranonkalanao, hanidy ary hanokatra indray ny mpitety tranonkalanao (tsy ny tabilao misy ny Cacti ihany) ary hanandrana indray, alohan'ny hampandrenesana olana any amin'ny The Cacti Group"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "On rare occasions, we have had reports from users who experience some minor issues due to changes in the code.  These issues are caused by the browser retaining pre-upgrade code and whilst we have taken steps to minimise the chances of this, it may still occur.  If you need instructions on how to clear your browser cache, <a href='https://www.refreshyourcache.com' target='_blank'>https://www.refreshyourcache.com/</a> is a good starting point."
msgstr "Amin'ny tranga mahalana dia nahazo tatitra avy amin'ny mpampiasa izahay izay sendra olana madinika noho ny fanovana tao amin'ny kaody. Ireo olana ireo dia vokatry ny fitazonan'ny mpitety tranonkala ny kaody talohan'ny fanavaozana, ary na dia efa nandray fepetra hampihenana ny mety hitrangan'izany aza izahay, dia mbola mety hitranga izany. Raha mila torolalana momba ny fomba famafana ny tahirin'ny mpitety tranonkalanao ianao, dia toerana tsara hanombohana ny <a href='https://www.refreshyourcache.com' target='_blank'>https://www.refreshyourcache.com/</a>."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "If after clearing your cache and restarting your browser, you still experience issues, please raise the issue with us and we will try to identify the cause of it."
msgstr "Raha mbola sendra olana ihany ianao aorian'ny famafana ny tahiry sy ny fanombohana indray ny mpitety tranonkalanao, dia mba ampahafantaro anay ny olana ary hiezaka hamantatra ny anton'izany izahay."

#: lib/installer.php
#, php-format
msgid "Downgrade from <strong>%s</strong> to <strong>%s</strong>"
msgstr "Fampidinana dikan-teny avy amin'ny <strong>%1$s</strong> mankany amin'ny <strong>%2$s</strong>"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "You appear to be downgrading to a previous version.  Database changes made for the newer version will not be reversed and <i>could</i> cause issues."
msgstr "Toa midina amin'ny dikan-teny teo aloha ianao. Tsy haverina amin'ny laoniny ny fanovana angon-drakitra natao ho an'ny dikan-teny vaovao kokoa ary <i>mety</i> hiteraka olana."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Please select the type of installation"
msgstr "Safidio azafady ny karazam-pametrahana"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Installation options:"
msgstr "Safidin'ny fametrahana:"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Choose this for the Primary site."
msgstr "Safidio ity ho an'ny toerana voalohany."

#: lib/installer.php
