#, php-format
msgid "Server Operating System Type: <b>%s</b>"
msgstr "Karazana rafitra fiasan'ny mpizara: <b>%s</b>"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Central Database Connection Information"
msgstr "Fampahalalana momba ny fifandraisana amin'ny angon-drakitra foibe"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Configuration Readonly!"
msgstr "Kirakira vakiana ihany!"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Your config.php file must be writable by the web server during install in order to configure the Remote poller.  Once installation is complete, you must set this file to Read Only to prevent possible security issues."
msgstr "Tsy maintsy azon'ny mpizara tranonkala soratana ny rakitra config.php anao mandritra ny fametrahana mba handrindrana ny Poller lavitra. Rehefa vita ny fametrahana dia tsy maintsy apetrakao ho vakiana ihany ity rakitra ity mba hisorohana ny olana ara-piarovana mety hitranga."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Configuration of Poller"
msgstr "Kirakiran'ny Poller"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Your Remote Cacti Poller information has not been included in your config.php file.  Please review the config.php.dist, and set the variables: <i>$rdatabase_default, $rdatabase_username</i>, etc.  These variables must be set and point back to your Primary Cacti database server.  Correct this and try again."
msgstr "Tsy nampidirina tao amin'ny rakitra config.php anao ny fampahalalana momba ny Poller Cacti lavitra anao. Jereo azafady ny config.php.dist, ary amboary ireo fari-pikirana: <i>$rdatabase_default, $rdatabase_username</i>, sns. Tsy maintsy voafaritra ireo fari-pikirana ireo ary manondro miverina any amin'ny mpizara angon-drakitra Cacti voalohany anao. Ahitsio izany ary andramo indray."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Remote Poller Variables"
msgstr "Fari-pikiranan'ny Poller lavitra"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "The variables that must be set in the config.php file include the following:"
msgstr "Anisan'ny fari-pikirana tsy maintsy amboarina ao amin'ny rakitra config.php ireto manaraka ireto:"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "The Installer automatically assigns a $poller_id and adds it to the config.php file."
msgstr "Ny mpanampy amin'ny fametrahana dia manome ho azy ny $poller_id iray ary manampy izany ao amin'ny rakitra config.php."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Once the variables are all set in the config.php file, you must also grant the $rdatabase_username access to the main Cacti database server.  Follow the same procedure you would with any other Cacti install.  You may then press the 'Test Connection' button.  If the test is successful you will be able to proceed and complete the install."
msgstr "Rehefa voarindra avokoa ireo ova ao amin'ny rakitra config.php, dia tsy maintsy omenao alalana hiditra amin'ny mpizara angon-drakitra fototra Cacti ihany koa ny $rdatabase_username.  Araho ny fomba fiasa mitovy amin'ny fametrahana Cacti hafa rehetra.  Azonao tsindriana avy eo ny bokotra 'Fitsapana ny fifandraisana'.  Raha mahomby ny fitsapana dia afaka manohy sy mamita ny fametrahana ianao."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Additional Steps After Installation"
msgstr "Dingana fanampiny aorian'ny fametrahana"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "It is essential that the Central Cacti server can communicate via MySQL to each remote Cacti database server.  Once the install is complete, you must edit the Remote Data Collector and ensure the settings are correct.  You can verify using the 'Test Connection' when editing the Remote Data Collector."
msgstr "Tena ilaina ny ahafahan'ny mpizara Cacti foibe mifandray amin'ny alalan'ny MySQL amin'ny mpizara angon-drakitra Cacti lavitra tsirairay.  Rehefa vita ny fametrahana, dia tsy maintsy manova ny Mpanangona Angon-drakitra Lavitra ianao ary manamarina fa marina ireo fikirakirana.  Azonao atao ny manamarina izany amin'ny fampiasana ny 'Fitsapana ny fifandraisana' rehefa manova ny Mpanangona Angon-drakitra Lavitra."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Critical Binary Locations and Versions"
msgstr "Toerana sy kinovan'ny rakitra binary manan-danja"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Make sure all of these values are correct before continuing."
msgstr "Ataovy azo antoka fa marina avokoa ireo sanda ireo alohan'ny hanohizana."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "One or more paths appear to be incorrect, unable to proceed"
msgstr "Toa diso ny lalana iray na maromaro, tsy afaka manohy"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Directory Permission Checks"
msgstr "Fanamarinana ny alalana amin'ny lahatahiry"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Please ensure the directory permissions below are correct before proceeding.  During the install, these directories need to be owned by the Web Server user.  These permission changes are required to allow the Installer to install Device Template packages which include XML and script files that will be placed in these directories.  If you choose not to install the packages, there is an 'install_package.php' cli script that can be used from the command line after the install is complete."
msgstr "Azafady, ataovy azo antoka fa marina ireo alalana amin'ny lahatahiry eto ambany alohan'ny hanohizana.  Mandritra ny fametrahana, ireo lahatahiry ireo dia tsy maintsy an'ny mpampiasa Mpizara Tranonkala.  Ireo fanovana alalana ireo dia ilaina mba hahafahan'ny Mpametraka mametraka ireo fonosana Modely Fitaovana izay ahitana rakitra XML sy rakitra script hapetraka ao amin'ireo lahatahiry ireo.  Raha misafidy ny tsy hametraka ireo fonosana ianao, dia misy rakitra script cli 'install_package.php' azo ampiasaina avy amin'ny baikon'ny rafitra rehefa vita ny fametrahana."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "After the install is complete, you can make some of these directories read only to increase security."
msgstr "Rehefa vita ny fametrahana, dia azonao atao ho azo vakina ihany ny sasany amin'ireo lahatahiry ireo mba hampitomboana ny fiarovana."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "These directories will be required to stay read writable after the install so that the Cacti remote synchronization process can update them as the Main Cacti Web Site changes"
msgstr "Ireo lahatahiry ireo dia tsy maintsy mijanona ho azo vakina sy azo soratana aorian'ny fametrahana mba hahafahan'ny fizotry ny fampifanarahana lavitra Cacti manavao azy ireo rehefa miova ny Tranonkala Fototra Cacti"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "If you are installing packages, once the packages are installed, you should change the scripts directory back to read only as this presents some exposure to the web site."
msgstr "Raha mametraka fonosana ianao, rehefa tafapetraka ireo fonosana, dia tokony haverinao ho azo vakina ihany ny lahatahiry scripts satria miteraka loza ara-piarovana ho an'ny tranonkala izany."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "For remote pollers, it is critical that the paths that you will be updating frequently, including the plugins, scripts, and resources paths have read/write access as the data collector will have to update these paths from the main web server content."
msgstr "Ho an'ireo mpanangona lavitra, dia tena zava-dehibe ny hananan'ireo lalana havaozinao matetika, anisan'izany ny lalana plugins, scripts, ary resources, alalana hamaky sy hanoratra satria ny mpanangona angon-drakitra dia tsy maintsy manavao ireo lalana ireo avy amin'ny votoatin'ny mpizara tranonkala fototra."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Required Writable at Install Time Only"
msgstr "Ilaina azo soratana mandritra ny fametrahana ihany"

#: lib/installer.php package_import.php
msgid "Not Writable"
msgstr "Tsy azo soratana"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Required Writable after Install Complete"
msgstr "Ilaina azo soratana aorian'ny fahavitan'ny fametrahana"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Potential permission issues"
msgstr "Olana mety hitranga amin'ny alalana"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Please make sure that your webserver has read/write access to the cacti folders that show errors below."
msgstr "Azafady, ataovy azo antoka fa manana alalana hamaky sy hanoratra ao amin'ireo fampirimana cacti mampiseho hadisoana eto ambany ny mpizara tranonkalanao."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "If SELinux is enabled on your server, you can either permanently disable this, or temporarily disable it and then add the appropriate permissions using the SELinux command-line tools."
msgstr "Raha alefa ao amin'ny mpizaranao ny SELinux, dia azonao atao na ny manajanona azy io maharitra, na ny manajanona azy vetivety aloha dia manampy ireo alalana sahaza amin'ny fampiasana ny fitaovana baikon'ny rafitra SELinux."

#: lib/installer.php
#, php-format
msgid "The user '%s' should have MODIFY permission to enable read/write."
msgstr "Ny mpampiasa '%s' dia tokony hanana alalana MODIFY mba ahafahana mamaky sy manoratra."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "An example of how to set folder permissions is shown here, though you may need to adjust this depending on your operating system, user accounts and desired permissions."
msgstr "Aseho eto ny ohatra iray amin'ny fomba fametrahana ny alalan'ny fampirimana, na dia mety mila manitsy izany aza ianao arakaraka ny rafitra fiasanao, ny kaonty mpampiasa ary ny alalana irinao."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "EXAMPLE:"
msgstr "OHATRA:"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Once installation has completed the CSRF path, should be set to read-only."
msgstr "Rehefa vita ny fametrahana, ny lalana CSRF dia tokony hapetraka ho azo vakina ihany."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "All folders are writable"
msgstr "Azo soratana avokoa ny fampirimana rehetra"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Linux kernel security modules"
msgstr "Maodely fiarovana amin'ny kernel Linux"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Cacti needs to establish network connections, execute binaries and write files to work. Linux security features such as <b>SELinux</b>, <b>AppArmor</b> or <b>ModSecurity</b> may cause Cacti to become inoperable in some configurations. If problems occur, check the settings of these security tools.<br/><br/>"
msgstr "Mila manangana fifandraisana amin'ny tambajotra, manatanteraka rakitra binary ary manoratra rakitra ny Cacti mba hiasa. Ny fomba fiarovana amin'ny Linux toy ny <b>SELinux</b>, <b>AppArmor</b> na <b>ModSecurity</b> dia mety hahatonga ny Cacti tsy hiasa amin'ny fikirakirana sasany. Raha misy olana mitranga, jereo ny fikirakirana ireo fitaovana fiarovana ireo.<br/><br/>"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Input Validation Whitelist Protection"
msgstr "Fiarovana amin'ny lisitra fotsy fanamarinana fampidirana"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Cacti Data Input methods that call a script can be exploited in ways that a non-administrator can perform damage to either files owned by the poller account, and in cases where someone runs the Cacti poller as root, can compromise the operating system allowing attackers to exploit your infrastructure."
msgstr "Ny fomba fampidirana angon-drakitra Cacti izay miantso script dia azo araraotina amin'ny fomba ahafahan'ny olona tsy mpitantana manimba ny rakitra an'ny kaonty poller, ary amin'ny tranga izay itondran'ny olona iray ny Cacti poller amin'ny alalan'ny root, dia mety hanimba ny rafitra fiasa izany ka ahafahan'ny mpanafika manararaotra ny fotodrafitrasanao."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Therefore, several versions ago, Cacti was enhanced to provide Whitelist capabilities on the these types of Data Input Methods.  Though this does secure Cacti more thoroughly, it does increase the amount of work required by the Cacti administrator to import and manage Templates and Packages."
msgstr "Noho izany, kinova maromaro lasa izay, dia nohatsaraina ny Cacti mba hanome fahafahana mampiasa Lisitra Fotsy amin'ireo karazana Fomba Fampidirana Angon-drakitra ireo.  Na dia miaro kokoa ny Cacti aza izany, dia mampitombo ny asa takina amin'ny mpitantana ny Cacti mba hanafatra sy hitantana ny Modely sy ny Fonosana."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "The way that the Whitelisting works is that when you first import a Data Input Method, or you re-import a Data Input Method, and the script and or arguments change in any way, the Data Input Method, and all the corresponding Data Sources will be immediately disabled until the administrator validates that the Data Input Method is valid."
msgstr "Ny fomba fiasan'ny Lisitra Fotsy dia rehefa manafatra Fomba Fampidirana Angon-drakitra ianao voalohany, na manafatra indray Fomba Fampidirana Angon-drakitra, ka miova na amin'ny fomba ahoana na amin'ny fomba ahoana ny script sy/na ny mari-pamaritana, dia hajanona avy hatrany ilay Fomba Fampidirana Angon-drakitra sy ireo Loharanon'angon-drakitra mifanaraka aminy rehetra mandra-panamarinan'ny mpitantana fa manan-kery ilay Fomba Fampidirana Angon-drakitra."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "To make identifying Data Input Methods in this state, we have provided a validation script in Cacti's CLI directory that can be run with the following options:"
msgstr "Mba hanamorana ny famantarana ireo Fomba Fampidirana Angona (Data Input Methods) amin'ity toe-javatra ity, dia nanome script fanamarinana ao amin'ny lahatahiry CLI an'ny Cacti izahay izay azo alefa miaraka amin'ireto safidy manaraka ireto:"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "This script option will search for any Data Input Methods that are currently banned and provide details as to why."
msgstr "Ity safidin'ny script ity dia hitady izay Fomba Fampidirana Angona (Data Input Methods) voasakana amin'izao fotoana izao ary hanome ny antsipiriany momba ny antony."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "This script option un-ban the Data Input Methods that are currently banned."
msgstr "Ity safidin'ny script ity dia manala ny fanakanana amin'ireo Fomba Fampidirana Angona (Data Input Methods) voasakana amin'izao fotoana izao."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "This script option will re-enable any disabled Data Sources."
msgstr "Ity safidin'ny script ity dia hamerina hampiasa indray izay Loharanon'Angona (Data Sources) nakatona."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "It is strongly suggested that you update your config.php to enable this feature by uncommenting the <b>$input_whitelist</b> variable and then running the three CLI script options above after the web based install has completed.<br/><br/>"
msgstr "Amporisihina mafy ianao hanavao ny config.php mba hampandehanana ity fiasa ity amin'ny alalan'ny fanesorana ny fanamarihana (uncomment) eo amin'ny variable <b>$input_whitelist</b> ary avy eo mandefa ireo safidin'ny script CLI telo etsy ambony rehefa vita ny fametrahana amin'ny alalan'ny tranonkala.<br/><br/>"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Check the Checkbox below to acknowledge that you have read and understand this security concern"
msgstr "Mariho ny boaty eto ambany hanamarinana fa efa namaky sy mahazo ity olana ara-piarovana ity ianao"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "I have read this statement"
msgstr "Efa namaky ity fanambarana ity aho"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Admin email address"
msgstr "Adiresy mailaka an'ny mpitantana"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "In case of problems cacti can send emails to the administrator. The address filled in here will be assigned to the admin account and \"Notify Primary Admin of Issue\" will be enabled. You can change this setting and the email address later. Do not forget to set up the email settings after installation."
msgstr "Raha misy olana dia afaka mandefa mailaka any amin'ny mpitantana ny Cacti. Ny adiresy fenoina eto dia hatokana ho an'ny kaontin'ny mpitantana ary halefa ny \"Ampahafantaro ny Mpitantana Voalohany ny Olana\". Azonao ovaina any aoriana io toe-javatra io sy ny adiresy mailaka. Aza adino ny manamboatra ny fandrindrana ny mailaka aorian'ny fametrahana."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Default Profile"
msgstr "Profil Mahazatra"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Please select the default Data Source Profile to be used for polling sources. This is the maximum amount of time between scanning devices for information so the lower the polling interval, the more work is placed on the Cacti Server host. Long retention profiles store more data, so they take up more disk capacity. Their advantage is that older data is not as consolidated and is therefore more accurate than using shorter retention."
msgstr "Safidio azafady ny Profil-na Loharanon'Angona mahazatra hampiasaina amin'ny fanangonam-baovao (polling). Io no fotoana farafahabetsany eo anelanelan'ny fitiliana ireo fitaovana mba hahazoana vaovao, ka arakaraky ny hafohin'ny elanelam-potoana fanangonam-baovao no mampitombo ny asa ataon'ny mpampiantrano (host) lohamilina Cacti. Mitahiry angona betsaka kokoa ny profil fitahirizana maharitra, ka mitaky habaka kapila bebe kokoa. Ny tombony aminy dia tsy atambatra loatra ny angona taloha ka noho izany dia marimarina kokoa noho ny fampiasana fitahirizana fohy kokoa."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Also, select the intended, or configured Cron interval that you wish to use for Data Collection."
msgstr "Safidio ihany koa ny elanelam-potoana Cron kasaina na voarindra tianao hampiasaina amin'ny Fanangonana Angona."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Cron Interval"
msgstr "Elanelam-potoana Cron"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Default Automation Network"
msgstr "Tambajotra Fandehanana Ho Azy Mahazatra"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Cacti can automatically scan the network once installation has completed. This will utilise the network range below to work out the range of IPs that can be scanned.  A predefined set of options are defined for scanning which include using both 'public' and 'private' communities."
msgstr "Afaka mitily ho azy ny tambajotra ny Cacti rehefa vita ny fametrahana. Hampiasa ny sahan'ny tambajotra eto ambany izany mba hamaritana ny sahan'ny adiresy IP azo tiliana. Misy andiana safidy efa voafaritra mialoha natao ho an'ny fitiliana izay ahitana ny fampiasana ny vondrona (communities) 'public' sy 'private'."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "If your devices require a different set of options to be used first, you may define them below and they will be utilized before the defaults"
msgstr "Raha mila andiana safidy hafa ampiasaina aloha ny fitaovanao, dia azonao faritana eto ambany izany ary hampiasaina alohan'ireo safidy mahazatra"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "All options may be adjusted post installation"
msgstr "Ny safidy rehetra dia azo ahitsy aorian'ny fametrahana"

