#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Template Setup"
msgstr "Fanamboarana ny Modely"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Please select the Device Templates that you wish to update during the Upgrade."
msgstr "Safidio azafady ireo Modelin'ny Fitaovana (Device Templates) tianao havaozina mandritra ny Fanavaozana."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Updating Templates that you have already made modifications to is not advisable.  The Upgrade of the Templates will NOT remove modifications to Graph and Data Templates, and can lead to unexpected behavior.  However, if you have not made changes to any Graph, Data Query, or Data Template, reimporting the Package should not have any affect.  In that case, you would have to 'Sync Graphs' to from the Templates after update."
msgstr "Tsy tsara ny manavao ireo Modely izay efa nanaovanao fanovana. TSY hanala ny fanovana natao tamin'ny Modelin'ny Kisary (Graph Templates) sy Modelin'ny Angona (Data Templates) ny Fanavaozana ireo Modely, ary mety hiteraka fihetsika tsy ampoizina izany. Na izany aza, raha tsy nanao fanovana tamin'ny Kisary, Fanontaniana Angona (Data Query), na Modelin'ny Angona ianao, dia tsy tokony hisy fiantraikany ny fampidirana indray ny Fonosana (Package). Amin'izay tranga izay, dia mila manao 'Sync Graphs' avy amin'ireo Modely ianao aorian'ny fanavaozana."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Please select the Device Templates that you wish to use after the Install.  If your Operating System is Windows, you need to ensure that you select the 'Windows Device' Template.  If your Operating System is Linux/UNIX, make sure you select the 'Local Linux Machine' Device Template."
msgstr "Safidio azafady ireo Modelin'ny Fitaovana tianao hampiasaina aorian'ny Fametrahana. Raha Windows ny Rafitra Fiasanao (Operating System), dia mila manamarina ianao fa misafidy ny Modely 'Windows Device'. Raha Linux/UNIX ny Rafitra Fiasanao, ataovy azo antoka fa misafidy ny Modelin'ny Fitaovana 'Local Linux Machine' ianao."

#: lib/installer.php package.php package_import.php
msgid "Homepage"
msgstr "Pejy Fandraisana"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Device Templates allow you to monitor and graph a vast assortment of data within Cacti.  After you select the desired Device Templates, press 'Next' and the installation will complete.  Please be patient on this step, as the importation of the Device Templates can take a few minutes."
msgstr "Ireo Modelin'ny Fitaovana dia ahafahanao manara-maso sy manao kisary karazana angona maro be ao anatin'ny Cacti. Rehefa voafidinao ireo Modelin'ny Fitaovana irinao, dia tsindrio ny 'Manaraka' ('Next') dia ho vita ny fametrahana. Miandrasa am-paharetana azafady amin'ity dingana ity, satria mety haharitra minitra vitsivitsy ny fampidirana ireo Modelin'ny Fitaovana."

