#: lib/utility.php
msgid "InnoDB on-disk file format (Antelope or Barracuda); Barracuda is now the only format."
msgstr "Endriky ny rakitra InnoDB eo amin'ny kapila (Antelope na Barracuda); Barracuda sisa no hany endrika ankehitriny."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Antelope, Barracuda."
msgstr "Antelope, Barracuda."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Allow index key prefixes longer than 767 bytes (requires the Barracuda format)."
msgstr "Mamela ny tovonan'ny fanalahidin'ny tondro lava mihoatra ny 767 octets (mitaky ny endrika Barracuda)."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "ON/1 or OFF/0; this behaviour is now always enabled."
msgstr "ON/1 na OFF/0; alefa foana io fiasa io ankehitriny."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Total memory InnoDB uses to cache table and index data."
msgstr "Fitambaran'ny fitadidiana ampiasain'ny InnoDB hitahirizana vonjimaika ny angon'ny tabilao sy ny tondro."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Bytes; commonly 25%-80% of total system memory."
msgstr "Octets; matetika 25%-80% amin'ny fitambaran'ny fitadidian'ny rafitra."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Write pages twice (the doublewrite buffer) to protect against partial page writes."
msgstr "Manoratra ny pejy indroa (ny doublewrite buffer) mba hiarovana amin'ny fanoratana pejy tsy feno."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "ON or OFF."
msgstr "ON na OFF."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Legacy pool for the InnoDB internal data dictionary and structures."
msgstr "Fitehirizana taloha ho an'ny rakibolana angona anatiny sy ny rafitra InnoDB."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Bytes; obsolete on modern servers."
msgstr "Octets; lany andro amin'ny mpizara maoderina."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Seconds an InnoDB transaction waits for a row lock before giving up."
msgstr "Segondra hiandrasan'ny fifanakalozana InnoDB ny fanidiana andalana alohan'ny hijanonana."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Seconds; default 50."
msgstr "Segondra; 50 amin'ny fomba mahazatra."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Method used to flush data and log files to disk."
msgstr "Fomba ampiasaina hanosehana ny angona sy ny rakitra tatitra any amin'ny kapila."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "O_DIRECT, fsync, O_DSYNC, and similar."
msgstr "O_DIRECT, fsync, O_DSYNC, sy ny mitovy aminy."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Controls how the redo log is written and flushed at transaction commit."
msgstr "Mifehy ny fomba fanoratana sy fanosehana ny redo log rehefa vita ny fifanakalozana."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "0, 1, or 2."
msgstr "0, 1, na 2."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Legacy single setting for InnoDB file I/O threads, replaced by the read/write I/O thread settings."
msgstr "Fikirana tokana taloha ho an'ny thread I/O-n'ny rakitra InnoDB, nosoloina ny fikirana thread I/O famakiana/fanoratana."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Integer; superseded by innodb_read_io_threads and innodb_write_io_threads."
msgstr "Isa feno; nosoloan'ny innodb_read_io_threads sy innodb_write_io_threads."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Write and flush the InnoDB redo log every N seconds."
msgstr "Manoratra sy manosika ny redo log InnoDB isaky ny N segondra."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Seconds (1-2700); default 1."
msgstr "Segondra (1-2700); 1 amin'ny fomba mahazatra."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Number of I/O threads used for read operations in InnoDB."
msgstr "Isan'ny thread I/O ampiasaina amin'ny asa famakiana ao amin'ny InnoDB."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "1-64; default 4."
msgstr "1-64; 4 amin'ny fomba mahazatra."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Number of I/O threads used for write operations in InnoDB."
msgstr "Isan'ny thread I/O ampiasaina amin'ny asa fanoratana ao amin'ny InnoDB."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Number of regions the InnoDB buffer pool is divided into."
msgstr "Isan'ny faritra izarana ny buffer pool InnoDB."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "1-64; MariaDB removed this in 10.6."
msgstr "1-64; nesorin'ny MariaDB tamin'ny 10.6 izany."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Estimated I/O operations per second available to InnoDB background tasks."
msgstr "Tomban'isan'ny asa I/O isan-tsegondra azo ampiasaina ho an'ny asa ao ambadiky ny InnoDB."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Integer; use higher values for SSD/NVMe storage."
msgstr "Isa feno; ampiasao sanda ambony kokoa ho an'ny fitehirizana SSD/NVMe."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Maximum IOPS InnoDB may use when flushing falls behind."
msgstr "IOPS fara-fahabetsany azon'ny InnoDB ampiasaina rehefa tara ny fanosehana."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Flush neighbouring dirty pages in the same extent when flushing a page."
msgstr "Manosika ny pejy voaova mifanila ao anatin'ny extent iray ihany rehefa manosika pejy iray."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "0, 1, or 2; use 0 on SSD storage."
msgstr "0, 1, na 2; ampiasao ny 0 amin'ny fitehirizana SSD."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Use hardware atomic writes (MariaDB) so the doublewrite buffer can be safely disabled."
msgstr "Mampiasa fanoratana atômika ara-pitaovana (MariaDB) mba hahafahana manafoana am-pilaminana ny doublewrite buffer."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "ON or OFF; MariaDB only."
msgstr "ON na OFF; ho an'ny MariaDB ihany."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Enforce strict snapshot isolation for InnoDB transactions."
msgstr "Mampihatra fitokana-monina saripika hentitra ho an'ny fifanakalozana InnoDB."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "ON or OFF; back-ported to MariaDB 10.6.18+, 10.11.8+ and 11.4.2+. Set OFF for the Cacti poller."
msgstr "ON na OFF; naverina nampidirina tao amin'ny MariaDB 10.6.18+, 10.11.8+ ary 11.4.2+. Ataovy OFF ho an'ny mpanangona angona Cacti."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Removed"
msgstr "Nesorina"

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Deprecated"
msgstr "Tsy ampiasaina intsony"

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Not applicable to this engine"
msgstr "Tsy mihatra amin'ity maotera ity"

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Supported"
msgstr "Tohanana"

#: lib/utility.php
#, php-format
msgid "%s Variable Capability Matrix"
msgstr "Tabilao Fahaiza-manao Fariovana %s"

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Support by engine and version for each Cacti-recommended variable"
msgstr "Fanohanana araka ny maotera sy ny dikan-teny ho an'ny fariovana tsirairay atolotry ny Cacti"

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Variable"
msgstr "Fariovana"

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Available settings:"
msgstr "Fikirana misy:"

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "N/A - Not applicable to this engine"
msgstr "N/A - Tsy mihatra amin'ity maotera ity"

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "MariaDB 10.11+ and MySQL 8.4+ are the recommended, supported releases for Cacti 1.3.x (available on Rocky Linux 9 through the vendor module streams). Make sure you run the very latest release though which fixes a long standing low level networking issue that was causing spine many issues with reliability."
msgstr "MariaDB 10.11+ sy MySQL 8.4+ no dikan-teny atolotra sy tohanana ho an'ny Cacti 1.3.x (misy ao amin'ny Rocky Linux 9 amin'ny alalan'ny vendor module streams). Ataovy izay hampiasana ny dikan-teny farany indrindra izay manamboatra olana tambajotra ambany lenta efa ela izay niteraka olana maro teo amin'ny fahamendrehan'ny Spine."

#: lib/utility.php
#, php-format
msgid "It is STRONGLY recommended that you enable InnoDB in any %s version greater than 5.5.3."
msgstr "Soso-kevitra MAFY ny handefasanao ny InnoDB amin'ny dikan-teny %s rehetra mihoatra ny 5.5.3."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "When using Cacti with languages other than English, it is important to use the utf8mb4_unicode_ci collation type as some characters take more than a single byte."
msgstr "Rehefa mampiasa ny Cacti amin'ny fiteny hafa ankoatra ny teny anglisy dia zava-dehibe ny fampiasana ny karazana fandaharana utf8mb4_unicode_ci satria misy litera mitaky mihoatra ny octet tokana."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "When using Cacti with languages other than English, it is important to use the utf8mb4 character set as some characters take more than a single byte."
msgstr "Rehefa mampiasa ny Cacti amin'ny fiteny hafa ankoatra ny teny anglisy dia zava-dehibe ny fampiasana ny andian-tsoratra utf8mb4 satria misy litera mitaky mihoatra ny octet tokana."

#: lib/utility.php
#, php-format
msgid "It is recommended that you enable InnoDB in any %s version greater than 5.1."
msgstr "Soso-kevitra ny handefasanao ny InnoDB amin'ny dikan-teny %s rehetra mihoatra ny 5.1."

#: lib/utility.php
#, php-format
msgid "Depending on the number of logins and use of spine data collector, %s will need many connections.  The calculation for spine is: total_connections = total_processes * (total_threads + script_servers + 1), then you must leave headroom for user connections, which will change depending on the number of concurrent login accounts."
msgstr "Arakaraka ny isan'ny fidirana sy ny fampiasana ny mpanangona angona Spine, dia mila fifandraisana maro ny %s. Ny kajy ho an'ny Spine dia: total_connections = total_processes * (total_threads + script_servers + 1), avy eo tsy maintsy mamela elanelana ho an'ny fifandraisan'ny mpampiasa ianao, izay hiovaova arakaraka ny isan'ny kaonty miditra miaraka."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Keeping the table cache larger means less file open/close operations when using innodb_file_per_table."
msgstr "Ny fitazonana ny cache-n'ny tabilao ho lehibe kokoa dia midika hoe vitsy kokoa ny asa fanokafana/fanakatonana rakitra rehefa mampiasa innodb_file_per_table."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "With Remote polling capabilities, large amounts of data will be synced from the main server to the remote pollers.  Therefore, keep this value at or above 16M."
msgstr "Miaraka amin'ny fahaiza-manao fakana angona lavitra, dia angona betsaka no hampifanarahina avy amin'ny mpizara fototra mankany amin'ny mpanangona angona lavitra. Noho izany, tazomy ho 16M na mihoatra io sanda io."

#: lib/utility.php
#, php-format
msgid "If using the Cacti Performance Booster and choosing a memory storage engine, you have to be careful to flush your Performance Booster buffer before the system runs out of memory table space.  This is done two ways, first reducing the size of your output column to just the right size.  This column is in the tables poller_output, and poller_output_boost.  The second thing you can do is allocate more memory to memory tables.  We have arbitrarily chosen a recommended value of 10%% of system memory, but if you are using SSD disk drives, or have a smaller system, you may ignore this recommendation or choose a different storage engine.  You may see the expected consumption of the Performance Booster tables under Console -> System Utilities -> View Boost Status."
msgstr "Raha mampiasa ny Cacti Performance Booster ianao ary misafidy motera fitahirizana anaty fitadidiana, dia tsy maintsy mitandrina ianao hanadio ny buffer-n'ny Performance Booster alohan'ny hahalany ny habaka ho an'ny tabilao anaty fitadidiana ao amin'ny rafitra. Azo atao amin'ny fomba roa izany: voalohany, ny fampihenana ny haben'ny tsanganana famoahana ho amin'ny habe sahaza indrindra. Ao amin'ny tabilao poller_output sy poller_output_boost io tsanganana io. Ny zavatra faharoa azonao atao dia ny manokana fitadidiana bebe kokoa ho an'ny tabilao anaty fitadidiana. Nisafidy sanda atolotra 10%% amin'ny fitadidian'ny rafitra izahay, saingy raha mampiasa kapila SSD ianao, na manana rafitra kely kokoa, dia azonao atao ny tsy miraharaha ity soso-kevitra ity na misafidy motera fitahirizana hafa. Azonao jerena ny fandaniana andrasana ho an'ny tabilao Performance Booster ao amin'ny Console -> System Utilities -> View Boost Status."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "When executing subqueries, having a larger temporary table size, keep those temporary tables in memory."
msgstr "Rehefa manatanteraka fangatahana anatiny (subqueries), ny fananana haben'ny tabilao vonjimaika lehibe kokoa dia mitazona ireo tabilao vonjimaika ireo ao anaty fitadidiana."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "If this number is negative, reduce the innodb_buffer_pool_size until the join_buffer_size turns positive, but allocate approximately from between 25%-50% of memory to the innodb_buffer_pool_size if the database is hosted on the Cacti server, or upto 80% of the systems memory if the database is separate from the Cacti web server.  However, try to not go below the default of 262,144.  When performing joins, if they are below this size, they will be kept in memory and never written to a temporary file.  As this is a per connection memory allocation, care must be taken not to increase it too high.  The sum of the join_buffer_size + sort_buffer_size + read_buffer_size + read_rnd_buffer_size + thread_stack + binlog_cache_size + Core MySQL/MariaDB memory should be below 80% if the database is hosted on the Cacti web server and less if you intend to have very large RRDfiles or hundreds of thousands to millions long term."
msgstr "Raha miiba io isa io, dia ahena ny innodb_buffer_pool_size mandra-pahatongan'ny join_buffer_size ho miabo, fa manokàna eo ho eo amin'ny 25%-50% amin'ny fitadidiana ho an'ny innodb_buffer_pool_size raha toa ka ao amin'ny lohamilina Cacti ihany no misy ny angon-drakitra, na hatramin'ny 80% amin'ny fitadidian'ny rafitra raha misaraka amin'ny lohamilina tranonkala Cacti ny angon-drakitra. Na izany aza, miezaha mba tsy hidina ambanin'ny sanda fototra 262,144. Rehefa manao fampifandraisana tabilao (joins), raha ambanin'io habe io izy ireo, dia ho voatahiry ao anaty fitadidiana ary tsy ho voasoratra ao amin'ny rakitra vonjimaika mihitsy. Satria fanokanana fitadidiana isaky ny fifandraisana izany, dia tsy maintsy mitandrina mba tsy hampitombo azy loatra. Ny fitambaran'ny join_buffer_size + sort_buffer_size + read_buffer_size + read_rnd_buffer_size + thread_stack + binlog_cache_size + fitadidiana fototra MySQL/MariaDB dia tokony ho latsaky ny 80% raha ao amin'ny lohamilina tranonkala Cacti ny angon-drakitra, ary mbola latsaka kokoa raha mikasa ny hanana RRDfiles lehibe dia lehibe na an-hetsiny ka hatramin'ny an-tapitrisany ianao amin'ny fotoana maharitra."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "If this number is negative, reduce the innodb_buffer_pool_size until the sort_buffer_size turns positive, but allocate approximately from between 25%-50% of memory to the innodb_buffer_pool_size if the database is hosted on the Cacti server, or upto 80% of the system memory if the database is separate from the Cacti web server.  However, try to not go below the default setting of 2,097,152.  A sort buffer performs sorts for some queries using ORDER BY or GROUP BY. Configuring sort_buffer_size decides how much memory will be allocated for sort queries.  The sort_buffer_size may need to be adjusted from the default if the workload requires a significant number of sort queries. The sort_buffer_size is defined on a per-session variable.  Use the same equation as that of the join_buffer_size to determine the per connection possible memory."
msgstr "Raha miiba io isa io, dia ahena ny innodb_buffer_pool_size mandra-pahatongan'ny sort_buffer_size ho miabo, fa manokàna eo ho eo amin'ny 25%-50% amin'ny fitadidiana ho an'ny innodb_buffer_pool_size raha toa ka ao amin'ny lohamilina Cacti ihany no misy ny angon-drakitra, na hatramin'ny 80% amin'ny fitadidian'ny rafitra raha misaraka amin'ny lohamilina tranonkala Cacti ny angon-drakitra. Na izany aza, miezaha mba tsy hidina ambanin'ny fandaharana fototra 2,097,152. Ny buffer fanasokajiana dia manao fanasokajiana ho an'ny fangatahana sasany mampiasa ORDER BY na GROUP BY. Ny fanamboarana ny sort_buffer_size no mamaritra ny habetsahan'ny fitadidiana hatokana ho an'ny fangatahana fanasokajiana. Mety mila ahitsy hiala amin'ny sanda fototra ny sort_buffer_size raha mitaky fangatahana fanasokajiana maro dia maro ny asa atao. Faritana amin'ny alalan'ny variable isaky ny fivoriana (per-session) ny sort_buffer_size. Ampiasao ny raikipohy mitovy amin'ny an'ny join_buffer_size mba hamaritana ny fitadidiana mety ilaina isaky ny fifandraisana."

#: lib/utility.php
#, php-format
msgid "When using InnoDB storage it is important to keep your table spaces separate.  This makes managing the tables simpler for long time users of %s.  If you are running with this currently off, you can migrate to the per file storage by enabling the feature, and then running an alter statement on all InnoDB tables."
msgstr "Rehefa mampiasa ny fitahirizana InnoDB dia zava-dehibe ny mitazona ny habaky ny tabilao ho misaraka. Izany dia manamora ny fitantanana ny tabilao ho an'ireo mpampiasa efa ela ny %s. Raha maty io endri-javatra io amin'izao fotoana izao, dia azonao atao ny mifindra amin'ny fitahirizana isaky ny rakitra amin'ny alalan'ny fampandehanana ilay endri-javatra, ary avy eo dia manatanteraka baikon'ny fanovana (ALTER) amin'ny tabilao InnoDB rehetra."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "When using innodb_file_per_table, it is important to set the innodb_file_format to Barracuda.  This setting will allow longer indexes important for certain Cacti tables."
msgstr "Rehefa mampiasa ny innodb_file_per_table, dia zava-dehibe ny mametraka ny innodb_file_format ho Barracuda. Ity fandaharana ity dia ahafahana manana tondro (indexes) lava kokoa izay zava-dehibe ho an'ny tabilao Cacti sasany."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "If your tables have very large indexes, you must operate with the Barracuda innodb_file_format and the innodb_large_prefix equal to 1.  Failure to do this may result in plugins that can not properly create tables."
msgstr "Raha manana tondro (indexes) lehibe dia lehibe ny tabilaonao, dia tsy maintsy miasa amin'ny innodb_file_format Barracuda sy innodb_large_prefix mitovy amin'ny 1 ianao. Ny tsy fanatanterahana izany dia mety hahatonga ny plugins tsy hahavita hamorona tabilao araka ny tokony ho izy."

#: lib/utility.php
#, no-php-format
msgid "InnoDB will hold as much tables and indexes in system memory as is possible.  Therefore, you should make the innodb_buffer_pool large enough to hold as much of the tables and index in memory.  Checking the size of the /var/lib/mysql/cacti directory will help in determining this value.  We are recommending 25%% of your systems total memory, but your requirements will vary depending on your systems size.  If you database is very large or remote, you can consider increasing this size.  If remote, it can by as high as 80% of the systems memory.  However, cautions must be taken to reduce the swappiness of the system, or to remove swap to keep the system from swapping."
msgstr "Ny InnoDB dia hitazona tabilao sy tondro (indexes) betsaka araka izay azo atao ao amin'ny fitadidian'ny rafitra. Noho izany, dia tokony hataonao lehibe ampy hitazonana ny tabilao sy ny tondro betsaka indrindra ao anaty fitadidiana ny innodb_buffer_pool. Ny fanamarinana ny haben'ny lahatahiry /var/lib/mysql/cacti dia hanampy amin'ny famaritana io sanda io. Manoro hevitra izahay mba ho 25%% amin'ny fitadidiana manontolon'ny rafitrao izany, saingy hiovaova arakaraka ny haben'ny rafitrao ny filanao. Raha lehibe dia lehibe na lavitra ny angon-drakitrao, dia azonao atao ny mieritreritra ny hampitombo io habe io. Raha lavitra izany, dia mety hahatratra hatramin'ny 80% amin'ny fitadidian'ny rafitra. Na izany aza, tsy maintsy mitandrina ianao amin'ny fampihenana ny swappiness an'ny rafitra, na ny fanesorana ny swap mba hisorohana ny rafitra tsy hanao swapping."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "This setting should remain ON unless your Cacti instances are running on either ZFS or FusionI/O which both have internal journaling to accommodate abrupt system crashes.  However, if you have very good power, and your systems rarely go down and you have backups, turning this setting to OFF can net you almost a 50% increase in database performance."
msgstr "Tokony hijanona ho ON ity fikirakirana ity raha tsy hoe mandeha amin'ny ZFS na FusionI/O izay samy manana fitantanana diarin'asa anatiny hiatrehana ny fahatapahan'ny rafitra tampoka ny Cacti-nao. Na izany aza, raha manana herinaratra tsara tokoa ianao, ary mahalana vao maty ny rafitrao sady manana tahiry fiarovana ianao, ny famadihana ity fikirakirana ity ho OFF dia mety hampitombo saika 50% ny fahombiazan'ny angon-drakitra."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "This is where metadata is stored. If you had a lot of tables, it would be useful to increase this."
msgstr "Eto no itehirizana ny metadata. Raha manana tabilao maro ianao dia ilaina ny mampitombo ity sanda ity."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Rogue queries should not for the database to go offline to others.  Kill these queries before they kill your system."
msgstr "Tsy tokony hanery ny angon-drakitra ho tapaka ho an'ny hafa ny fangatahana mandeha tsy ara-dalàna. Atsaharo ireo fangatahana ireo alohan'ny hanimbany ny rafitrao."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Maximum I/O performance happens when you use the O_DIRECT method to flush pages."
msgstr "Ny fahombiazana ambony indrindra amin'ny I/O dia mitranga rehefa mampiasa ny fomba O_DIRECT ianao handefasana ny pejy."

#: lib/utility.php
#, php-format
msgid "Setting this value to 2 means that you will flush all transactions every second rather than at commit.  This allows %s to perform writing less often."
msgstr "Ny fametrahana ity sanda ity ho 2 dia midika fa handefa ny fifanakalozana rehetra isan-tsegondra ianao fa tsy isaky ny fanamafisana (commit). Izany dia ahafahan'ny %s manoratra mahalana kokoa."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "With modern SSD type storage, having multiple io threads is advantageous for applications with high io characteristics."
msgstr "Amin'ny fitahirizana karazana SSD maoderina, ny fananana kofehy io maro dia mahasoa ho an'ny rindranasa manana toetra io avo lenta."

#: lib/utility.php
#, php-format
msgid "As of %s %s, the you can control how often %s flushes transactions to disk.  The default is 1 second, but in high I/O systems setting to a value greater than 1 can allow disk I/O to be more sequential"
msgstr "Hatramin'ny %1$s %2$s, azonao fehezina ny fahatetehan'ny fandefasan'ny %3$s ny fifanakalozana mankany amin'ny kapila. 1 segondra ny mahazatra, saingy amin'ny rafitra manana I/O avo dia ny fametrahana sanda mihoatra ny 1 no ahafahan'ny I/O amin'ny kapila mandeha milamina kokoa"

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "With modern SSD type storage, having multiple read io threads is advantageous for applications with high io characteristics.  Depending on your MariaDB/MySQL versions, this value can go as high as 64.  But try to keep the number less than your total SMT threads on the database server."
msgstr "Amin'ny fitahirizana karazana SSD maoderina, ny fananana kofehy io famakiana maro dia mahasoa ho an'ny rindranasa manana toetra io avo lenta. Arakaraka ny kinovan'ny MariaDB/MySQL ampiasainao, ity sanda ity dia mety hahatratra hatramin'ny 64. Nefa andramo tazonina ho latsaky ny fitambaran'ny kofehy SMT ao amin'ny lohamilin'ny angon-drakitrao ny isa."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "With modern SSD type storage, having multiple write io threads is advantageous for applications with high io characteristics.  Depending on your MariaDB/MySQL versions, this value can go as high as 64.  But try to keep the number less than your total SMT threads on the database server."
msgstr "Amin'ny fitahirizana karazana SSD maoderina, ny fananana kofehy io fanoratana maro dia mahasoa ho an'ny rindranasa manana toetra io avo lenta. Arakaraka ny kinovan'ny MariaDB/MySQL ampiasainao, ity sanda ity dia mety hahatratra hatramin'ny 64. Nefa andramo tazonina ho latsaky ny fitambaran'ny kofehy SMT ao amin'ny lohamilin'ny angon-drakitrao ny isa."

#: lib/utility.php
#, php-format
msgid "%s will divide the innodb_buffer_pool into memory regions to improve performance for versions of MariaDB less than 10.5.  The max value is 64, but should not exceed more than the number of CPU cores/threads.  When your innodb_buffer_pool is less than 1GB, you should use the pool size divided by 128MB.  Continue to use this equation up to the max the number of CPU cores or 64."
msgstr "Ny %s dia hizara ny innodb_buffer_pool ho faritra fitadidiana maromaro mba hanatsarana ny fahombiazana ho an'ny kinovan'ny MariaDB latsaky ny 10.5. Ny sanda ambony indrindra dia 64, saingy tsy tokony hihoatra ny isan'ny CPU cores/threads. Rehefa latsaky ny 1GB ny innodb_buffer_pool-nao dia tokony hampiasa ny haben'ny pool nozaraina 128MB ianao. Tohizo ny fampiasana io kajy io hatramin'ny ambony indrindra amin'ny isan'ny CPU cores na 64."

#: lib/utility.php
#, php-format
msgid "%s will divide the innodb_buffer_pool into memory regions to improve performance for versions of MySQL upto and including MySQL 8.0.  The max value is 64, but should not exceed more than the number of CPU cores/threads.  When your innodb_buffer_pool is less than 1GB, you should use the pool size divided by 128MB.  Continue to use this equation up to the max of the number of CPU cores or 64."
msgstr "Ny %s dia hizara ny innodb_buffer_pool ho faritra fitadidiana maromaro mba hanatsarana ny fahombiazana ho an'ny kinovan'ny MySQL hatramin'ny MySQL 8.0. Ny sanda ambony indrindra dia 64, saingy tsy tokony hihoatra ny isan'ny CPU cores/threads. Rehefa latsaky ny 1GB ny innodb_buffer_pool-nao dia tokony hampiasa ny haben'ny pool nozaraina 128MB ianao. Tohizo ny fampiasana io kajy io hatramin'ny ambony indrindra amin'ny isan'ny CPU cores na 64."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "If you have SSD disks, use this suggestion.  If you have physical hard drives, use 200 * the number of active drives in the array.  If using NVMe or PCIe Flash, much larger numbers as high as 100000 can be used."
msgstr "Raha manana kapila SSD ianao dia ampiasao ity soso-kevitra ity. Raha manana kapila mafy ara-batana ianao dia ampiasao ny 200 * isan'ny kapila miasa ao amin'ny laharan-kapila. Raha mampiasa NVMe na PCIe Flash dia azo ampiasaina ny isa lehibe lavitra hatramin'ny 100000."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "If you have SSD disks, use this suggestion.  If you have physical hard drives, use 2000 * the number of active drives in the array.  If using NVMe or PCIe Flash, much larger numbers as high as 200000 can be used."
msgstr "Raha manana kapila SSD ianao dia ampiasao ity soso-kevitra ity. Raha manana kapila mafy ara-batana ianao dia ampiasao ny 2000 * isan'ny kapila miasa ao amin'ny laharan-kapila. Raha mampiasa NVMe na PCIe Flash dia azo ampiasaina ny isa lehibe lavitra hatramin'ny 200000."

