#: lib/utility.php
msgid "When using MariaDB 10.2.4 and above, this setting should be off if atomic writes are enabled.  Therefore, please enable atomic writes instead of the double write buffer as it will increase performance."
msgstr "Rehefa mampiasa MariaDB 10.2.4 sy ny ambony dia tokony ho off ity fikirakirana ity raha alefa ny fanoratana atomika (atomic writes). Noho izany, alefaso ny fanoratana atomika fa tsy ny double write buffer satria hampitombo ny fahombiazana izany."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "When using MariaDB 10.2.4 and above, you can use atomic writes over the doublewrite buffer to increase performance."
msgstr "Rehefa mampiasa MariaDB 10.2.4 sy ny ambony dia azonao ampiasaina ny fanoratana atomika (atomic writes) fa tsy ny doublewrite buffer mba hampitomboana ny fahombiazana."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "MariaDB 11.8 enabled innodb_snapshot_isolation=ON by default. This causes severe lock contention: UPDATE statements can block for tens of thousands of seconds on small tables under concurrent load, which stalls the Cacti poller. Set innodb_snapshot_isolation=OFF in your [mysqld] configuration. See MDEV-39628."
msgstr "Ny MariaDB 11.8 dia nandefa ny innodb_snapshot_isolation=ON ho mahazatra. Izany dia miteraka fifaninanana hidy mafy: ny baikon'ny UPDATE dia mety hihitsoka mandritra ny segondra an'aliny amin'ny tabilao kely rehefa betsaka ny fangatahana miaraka, ka mampiato ny Cacti poller. Apetraho ho innodb_snapshot_isolation=OFF ao amin'ny fikirakirana [mysqld] anao. Jereo ny MDEV-39628."

